<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:10.600" end="00:00:16.360" style="s2">This is a Lyceum. Seven years ago, I was</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.120" end="00:00:16.360" style="s2">sold here like prey.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.680" end="00:00:23.480" style="s2">Now, I&#39;m back to take their lives.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.560" end="00:00:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO THE [ __ ] IS KNOCKING? GET YOUR ASS</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.480" end="00:00:26.920" style="s2">IN HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.200" end="00:00:28.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SIR, I BROUGHT your bottle.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.920" end="00:00:30.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, what do we have here? Keeping a</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.600" end="00:00:33.680" style="s2">little wildcat like you out front? COME</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.920" end="00:00:33.680" style="s2">JOIN THE FUN.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.080" end="00:00:38.480" style="s2">LOCK DOWN THE WHOLE BUILDING. THAT [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.000" end="00:00:41.440" style="s2">CAN&#39;T HAVE GOTTEN FAR. SEARCH EVERY</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.480" end="00:00:41.440" style="s2">GODDAMN ROOM.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.125" end="00:00:51.145" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.600" end="00:00:59.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CATCH ME? I&#39;M NOT THE HELPLESS PREY I</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.360" end="00:00:59.400" style="s2">WAS SEVEN years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.200" end="00:01:07.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.360" end="00:01:07.400" style="s2">What are you doing in my room?</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.800" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t checked this one. KICK IT IN.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.200" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep quiet. I need to use you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:20.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.880" end="00:01:27.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] Just a couple screwing. Next room.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.000" end="00:01:38.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice kiss. You&#39;re a good prop. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.720" end="00:01:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, you okay? They hit the club</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.240" end="00:01:49.160" style="s2">downstairs. Everyone&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.920" end="00:01:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find that woman. She used me like a damn</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.160" end="00:01:53.360" style="s2">prop. I&#39;m going to kill her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.000" end="00:01:53.920" style="s2">Any word on the woman I told you to find</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.360" end="00:01:55.600" style="s2">a month ago?</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.920" end="00:01:57.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Checked every guest at the hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.600" end="00:01:59.160" style="s2">Nothing. Even the surveillance footage</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.320" end="00:02:00.972" style="s2">was wiped clean.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.160" end="00:02:02.692" style="s2">I think she&#39;s with Black Stellar, the</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.972" end="00:02:04.372" style="s2">world&#39;s top assassin organization. The</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.692" end="00:02:07.492" style="s2">chaos they sparked nearly got Professor</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.372" end="00:02:09.332" style="s2">Harrison Van Dyke killed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.492" end="00:02:10.692" style="s2">Get to the point. For the past month,</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.332" end="00:02:12.532" style="s2">Dark Sun has been provoking Black</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.692" end="00:02:14.172" style="s2">Stellar, trying to draw them out. No one</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.532" end="00:02:15.652" style="s2">matching your description ever surfaced,</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.172" end="00:02:17.852" style="s2">but I just got a tip. A woman who looks</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.652" end="00:02:21.132" style="s2">exactly like the one you described is</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.852" end="00:02:21.132" style="s2">supposed to show up here today.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.612" end="00:02:24.172" style="s2">She&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.732" end="00:02:31.372" style="s2">Well, boss, is that her? I&#39;m not sure.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.612" end="00:02:34.732" style="s2">It was dark that night. I only saw her</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.372" end="00:02:34.732" style="s2">silhouette. So, what do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.372" end="00:02:39.932" style="s2">I want everything on her in 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.772" end="00:02:42.252" style="s2">Welcome home, Ms. Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.932" end="00:02:42.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.012" end="00:02:46.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found her. Her name is Evelyn Bloom, the</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.172" end="00:02:48.132" style="s2">daughter of Richard Bloom&#39;s first wife.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.932" end="00:02:50.092" style="s2">She vanished 7 years ago in a</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.132" end="00:02:53.772" style="s2">trafficking case. She&#39;d been engaged to</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.092" end="00:02:55.372" style="s2">our own Kevin Wilson since childhood.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.772" end="00:02:57.332" style="s2">Critical update.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.372" end="00:02:58.692" style="s2">Richard Bloom recently had her identity</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.332" end="00:03:00.692" style="s2">erased and had her declared legally</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.692" end="00:03:02.412" style="s2">dead. Kevin&#39;s about to get engaged to</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.692" end="00:03:04.292" style="s2">her younger sister, Lina.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.412" end="00:03:05.692" style="s2">I know who you mean. Right after she</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.292" end="00:03:07.532" style="s2">vanished, Kevin hooked up with her</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:10.012" style="s2">sister. If I&#39;m not wrong, their</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.532" end="00:03:11.972" style="s2">engagement is the day after tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.012" end="00:03:13.692" style="s2">The sister stole her fiance? When they</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.972" end="00:03:16.172" style="s2">run into each other, all hell&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.692" end="00:03:17.692" style="s2">break loose.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.172" end="00:03:19.972" style="s2">We&#39;ll see.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.692" end="00:03:21.612" style="s2">If she really is with Black Stellar,</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.972" end="00:03:24.012" style="s2">the Bloom house is in for one hell of a</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.612" end="00:03:24.012" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.772" end="00:03:35.292" style="s2">Ms. Lina, Ms. Evelyn has arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.332" end="00:03:36.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, Evelyn, you&#39;re actually alive. 7</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.292" end="00:03:38.132" style="s2">years on Elysian&#39;s black market must</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.652" end="00:03:40.012" style="s2">have been rough. Didn&#39;t catch some</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.132" end="00:03:41.332" style="s2">filthy disease, did you? Or come back</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.012" end="00:03:43.292" style="s2">with a few bastards whose fathers you</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.332" end="00:03:44.692" style="s2">can&#39;t even name?</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.292" end="00:03:47.412" style="s2">You used up piece of trash should have</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.692" end="00:03:49.252" style="s2">rotted in the slums. Kevin&#39;s mine. So is</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.412" end="00:03:51.172" style="s2">the Bloom Trust. You won&#39;t see a penny</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.252" end="00:03:54.412" style="s2">of it. Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.172" end="00:03:54.412" style="s2">I have to keep playing along.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.452" end="00:04:04.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t want me here, Lina, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.094" end="00:04:06.294" style="s2">leave. Why did you push me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.054" end="00:04:07.534" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You psycho! I didn&#39;t push you, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.294" end="00:04:09.454" style="s2">lying.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.534" end="00:04:11.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. While you&#39;re under my roof, you</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.454" end="00:04:13.254" style="s2">follow my rules. This is high society,</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.694" end="00:04:14.574" style="s2">so check that gutter trash attitude you</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.254" end="00:04:15.854" style="s2">picked up at the door.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.574" end="00:04:17.334" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.854" end="00:04:18.534" style="s2">Since I&#39;m obviously alive, shouldn&#39;t we</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.334" end="00:04:19.734" style="s2">have the lawyers petition the court to</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.534" end="00:04:20.934" style="s2">overturn my death declaration and</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.734" end="00:04:22.454" style="s2">restore my legal identity?</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.934" end="00:04:24.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve already been declared dead.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.454" end="00:04:25.614" style="s2">Reopening the case is a headache. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.694" end="00:04:27.294" style="s2">I&#39;ll have the lawyers handle it</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.614" end="00:04:28.374" style="s2">tomorrow. Go upstairs and get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.294" end="00:04:29.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.374" end="00:04:31.094" style="s2">It&#39;s been years since I&#39;ve been to the</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.414" end="00:04:31.654" style="s2">old Bloom house. I&#39;d like to stay there</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:33.894" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.654" end="00:04:35.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Remember your position and don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.894" end="00:04:37.014" style="s2">go wandering around. I won&#39;t have you</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.614" end="00:04:39.614" style="s2">embarrassing this family.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.014" end="00:04:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.974" end="00:04:44.694" style="s2">Dad, I swear I didn&#39;t push her. She</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.734" end="00:04:47.414" style="s2">staged the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.694" end="00:04:49.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. I know you&#39;re upset. The Wilsons</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.414" end="00:04:50.168" style="s2">are old money. They&#39;d never let a</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.014" end="00:04:51.814" style="s2">tainted woman into the family.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.168" end="00:04:54.254" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.814" end="00:04:54.254" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.374" end="00:05:01.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Evelyn&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.854" end="00:05:03.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin, you came running. Feel sorry for</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.694" end="00:05:04.334" style="s2">my sister? Thinking about getting back</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.374" end="00:05:06.414" style="s2">together with her?</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.334" end="00:05:07.534" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take her back? She spent 7 years on</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.414" end="00:05:09.934" style="s2">Elysian&#39;s black market. She&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.534" end="00:05:11.094" style="s2">disgrace. Lina, don&#39;t be ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.934" end="00:05:12.214" style="s2">You&#39;re the only woman I want. Our</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.094" end="00:05:14.454" style="s2">engagement party is happening right on</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.214" end="00:05:15.694" style="s2">schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.454" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Kevin.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.694" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">I knew you&#39;d always choose me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.654" end="00:05:35.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, nothing&#39;s happening at the Bloom</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.294" end="00:05:37.774" style="s2">estate. What if Evelyn only looks like</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.054" end="00:05:40.574" style="s2">the woman from that night?</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.774" end="00:05:40.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s ask her.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.734" end="00:05:47.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Him? The man from a month ago?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.894" end="00:05:48.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Bloom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.254" end="00:05:50.654" style="s2">I&#39;m Sebastian Wilson.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.614" end="00:05:53.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian? The man who runs the Wilson</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.654" end="00:05:54.294" style="s2">family? Damn it. If he finds out I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.014" end="00:05:56.054" style="s2">woman who grabbed him, kissed him, and</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.294" end="00:05:58.614" style="s2">tied him to that bed, I&#39;m screwed. He</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.054" end="00:05:58.614" style="s2">can&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.334" end="00:06:04.054" style="s2">You&#39;re Mr. Wilson?</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.254" end="00:06:05.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know me, Ms. Bloom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.054" end="00:06:06.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone knows who runs the Wilson</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.294" end="00:06:09.615" style="s2">family. I&#39;ve heard about you on the</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.975" end="00:06:11.375" style="s2">news, but we&#39;ve never met.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.615" end="00:06:14.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve come home, Miss Bloom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.375" end="00:06:14.015" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you inside with your family?</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.009" end="00:06:15.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.015" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They think</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.255" end="00:06:19.615" style="s2">after 7 years in a place like Elysian,</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.495" end="00:06:21.695" style="s2">I&#39;m permanently tainted. That I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.615" end="00:06:22.975" style="s2">belong in the Bloom house anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.695" end="00:06:24.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They failed to protect you, and now</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.975" end="00:06:26.935" style="s2">they&#39;re blaming the victim? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.415" end="00:06:29.655" style="s2">pathetic. Boss, want me to send someone</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.935" end="00:06:29.655" style="s2">in and talk to them?</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.655" end="00:06:34.495" style="s2">No. Miss Bloom, my nephew broke your</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.535" end="00:06:36.375" style="s2">engagement without cause. The Wilson</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.495" end="00:06:37.775" style="s2">family owes you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.375" end="00:06:39.375" style="s2">If you have nowhere to go, stay at</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.775" end="00:06:41.015" style="s2">Wilson Manor for now. Take your time</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.375" end="00:06:42.415" style="s2">deciding what would make this right.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.015" end="00:06:44.095" style="s2">Whatever you ask for, I&#39;ll pay Kevin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.415" end="00:06:45.855" style="s2">debt. The woman I met a month ago would</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.095" end="00:06:48.615" style="s2">never accept charity. If she dare</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.855" end="00:06:50.175" style="s2">refuse, I&#39;ll have her dragged back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.615" end="00:06:53.815" style="s2">Is there some reason staying at Wilson</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.175" end="00:06:53.815" style="s2">Manor would be a problem, Miss Bloom?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.695" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Wilsons can keep those Bloom</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.855" end="00:07:00.175" style="s2">parasites off my back. It risks blowing</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.295" end="00:07:02.055" style="s2">my cover, but it also gives me the</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.175" end="00:07:03.695" style="s2">perfect chance to find out why the great</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.055" end="00:07:06.815" style="s2">Sebastian Wilson was in a lawless</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.695" end="00:07:09.415" style="s2">hellhole like Elysian a month ago.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.815" end="00:07:10.895" style="s2">Mr. Wilson, are you sure? I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.415" end="00:07:13.455" style="s2">to impose.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.895" end="00:07:13.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.575" end="00:07:17.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Wilson. I promise I&#39;m a</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.815" end="00:07:19.375" style="s2">very good girl. I won&#39;t be any trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.735" end="00:07:21.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in that easily?</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.375" end="00:07:23.495" style="s2">That timid little pushover can&#39;t be the</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.135" end="00:07:26.575" style="s2">wild, ruthless woman who tied me to a</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.495" end="00:07:26.575" style="s2">bed in Elysian.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.855" end="00:07:35.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Kevin is about to get engaged to</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.135" end="00:07:37.335" style="s2">Lena. If Miss Evelyn stays here now, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.455" end="00:07:38.615" style="s2">afraid Kevin may not take it well.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.335" end="00:07:40.215" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.615" end="00:07:41.575" style="s2">Norman, take her away.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.215" end="00:07:42.895" style="s2">The Wilson family has no use for</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.575" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">servants who tell their employer what to</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.895" end="00:07:45.455" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.895" end="00:07:47.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.455" end="00:07:49.040" style="s2">Mary, come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.020" end="00:07:49.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.135" end="00:07:54.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One wrong sentence and she was thrown</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.695" end="00:07:56.055" style="s2">out. The rumors were right. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.055" end="00:07:58.935" style="s2">volatile and ruthless.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.055" end="00:08:00.135" style="s2">I can&#39;t let my mask slip.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.935" end="00:08:02.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.135" end="00:08:03.455" style="s2">Did that scare you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.335" end="00:08:05.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.455" end="00:08:07.295" style="s2">I&#39;m just not used to a place like this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.855" end="00:08:10.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make yourself at home.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.295" end="00:08:10.977" style="s2">If you need anything, tell Norman.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.657" end="00:08:25.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.777" end="00:08:27.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.977" end="00:08:29.857" style="s2">Use Dark Sun&#39;s entire intelligence</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.577" end="00:08:32.497" style="s2">network. I want every detail of Evelyn</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.857" end="00:08:33.737" style="s2">Bloom&#39;s missing 7 years. Where she went,</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.497" end="00:08:35.657" style="s2">what happened to her, and how she made</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.737" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">it back to the Bloom family alive.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.657" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.617" end="00:08:45.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Norman, please ask him to reconsider.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.457" end="00:08:46.377" style="s2">I&#39;ve served the Wilson family for over</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.697" end="00:08:48.537" style="s2">10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.377" end="00:08:51.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His decision is final. Go. Don&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.537" end="00:08:51.497" style="s2">security remove you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.097" end="00:09:00.057" style="s2">Nova, our intel network picked up some</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.817" end="00:09:00.977" style="s2">chatter. Someone&#39;s looking into you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.057" end="00:09:03.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.977" end="00:09:06.017" style="s2">Interesting. I&#39;m on my way. Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.137" end="00:09:06.017" style="s2">who&#39;s got the nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.177" end="00:09:08.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do we stand on the Orion Syndicate</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.697" end="00:09:09.977" style="s2">deal?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.457" end="00:09:11.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orion Syndicate has become one of North</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.977" end="00:09:13.617" style="s2">America&#39;s top tech companies in under a</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.697" end="00:09:15.937" style="s2">year, but its founder is a complete</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.617" end="00:09:18.777" style="s2">ghost. Even our network can&#39;t identify</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.937" end="00:09:20.417" style="s2">them. Landing this deal won&#39;t be easy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.777" end="00:09:22.817" style="s2">But I just got word that Orion Syndicate</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.417" end="00:09:25.617" style="s2">CEO, Arthur Sterling, will be at the</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.817" end="00:09:25.617" style="s2">Abyss tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.697" end="00:09:29.937" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Abyss? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.977" end="00:09:31.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Its owner is just as mysterious. In</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.937" end="00:09:33.857" style="s2">only 3 months, it&#39;s become the hottest</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.537" end="00:09:36.217" style="s2">club in town, drawing the rich, famous,</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.857" end="00:09:37.617" style="s2">and powerful. Two shadowy empires rising</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.217" end="00:09:39.617" style="s2">at the same time, there may be a</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.617" end="00:09:42.577" style="s2">connection.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.617" end="00:09:45.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the car. I&#39;m going there myself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.577" end="00:09:45.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.057" end="00:10:06.457" style="s2">Boss, something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.257" end="00:10:09.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.457" end="00:10:09.857" style="s2">Just saw one hell of a rider.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.298" end="00:10:16.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s Sebastian doing out now? Doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.418" end="00:10:20.338" style="s2">matter. As far as he&#39;s concerned, his</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.498" end="00:10:20.338" style="s2">good little guest is fast asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.138" end="00:10:25.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn, man. You quietly announce you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.618" end="00:10:27.618" style="s2">getting engaged to Lena Bloom, the</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.778" end="00:10:28.618" style="s2">nationally famous prodigy? Nice.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.618" end="00:10:30.418" style="s2">Everything you spend at the Abyss</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.618" end="00:10:32.178" style="s2">tonight goes on the Wilson tag. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.418" end="00:10:33.538" style="s2">what I wanted to hear. Cheers.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.178" end="00:10:34.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, Kevin. I thought the family</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.538" end="00:10:36.018" style="s2">engagement was with Evelyn, the</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.658" end="00:10:37.258" style="s2">legitimate Bloom heiress. How did it</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.018" end="00:10:38.898" style="s2">become her little sister?</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.258" end="00:10:40.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Brad. Lena developed T-theory</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.898" end="00:10:41.818" style="s2">before she even graduated. Professor Van</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.378" end="00:10:43.018" style="s2">Dyke himself endorsed it. She&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.818" end="00:10:44.058" style="s2">places.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.018" end="00:10:45.618" style="s2">What would you pick? A brilliant</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.058" end="00:10:47.178" style="s2">socialite or some used-up wreck who</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.618" end="00:10:50.298" style="s2">spent 7 years being brutalized on</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.178" end="00:10:50.298" style="s2">Elysium&#39;s black market?</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.098" end="00:10:56.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy [ __ ] She&#39;s smoking hot. Hands down</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.418" end="00:10:58.738" style="s2">the hottest woman I&#39;ve ever seen on the</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.458" end="00:11:00.218" style="s2">West Coast. That body, that attitude,</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.738" end="00:11:01.858" style="s2">she blows your genius fiance Lena out of</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.218" end="00:11:03.378" style="s2">the water. Lena&#39;s the hottest socialite</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.858" end="00:11:05.778" style="s2">on the West Coast. No way anyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.378" end="00:11:05.778" style="s2">hotter.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.218" end="00:11:10.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.538" end="00:11:12.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, Kevin? You know her?</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.858" end="00:11:13.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen the old family photos. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.658" end="00:11:14.618" style="s2">Evelyn Bloom.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.618" end="00:11:18.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.618" end="00:11:18.058" style="s2">The woman who escaped Elysium?</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.498" end="00:11:24.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.738" end="00:11:25.938" style="s2">You sure that&#39;s Evelyn?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.338" end="00:11:27.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said 7 years on Elysium&#39;s black</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.938" end="00:11:28.898" style="s2">market turned her into a walking corpse.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.378" end="00:11:31.058" style="s2">She sure doesn&#39;t look like one. Heavy</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.898" end="00:11:34.818" style="s2">makeup? Maybe plastic surgery?</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.058" end="00:11:34.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane? That&#39;s all natural.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.458" end="00:11:38.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Arthur Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.978" end="00:11:38.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the current CEO of Orion</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.298" end="00:11:39.938" style="s2">Syndicate?</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.938" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.938" end="00:11:42.178" style="s2">The Wilsons have been trying to do</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.898" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">business with him, but we can&#39;t even get</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.178" end="00:11:44.898" style="s2">a meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.298" end="00:11:46.458" style="s2">How the hell does Evelyn know him?</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.898" end="00:11:48.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe the fallen Bloom heiress works as</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.458" end="00:11:49.698" style="s2">a high-end escort now, and Arthur&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.218" end="00:11:51.498" style="s2">VIP she&#39;s servicing tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.698" end="00:11:52.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Makes perfect sense. 7 years on</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.498" end="00:11:54.098" style="s2">Elysium&#39;s black market and she never</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.778" end="00:11:55.938" style="s2">even finished school. What else can she</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.098" end="00:11:57.778" style="s2">do? That body is all she have. So, she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.938" end="00:11:59.178" style="s2">in there trading sex for cash.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.778" end="00:12:01.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The engagement may be over, but everyone</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.178" end="00:12:03.218" style="s2">still knows her as my former fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.898" end="00:12:04.618" style="s2">I won&#39;t let her [ __ ] herself out and</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.218" end="00:12:08.258" style="s2">drag the Wilson name through the mud.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.618" end="00:12:08.258" style="s2">No, I&#39;m dragging her out of there.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.938" end="00:12:14.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; U- Uncle Sebastian?</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.898" end="00:12:16.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here? And who exactly</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.419" end="00:12:18.219" style="s2">are you planning to drag out of here?</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.339" end="00:12:19.379" style="s2">Kevin, you&#39;re about to get engaged. Stay</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.219" end="00:12:20.859" style="s2">out of places like this. Take your</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.379" end="00:12:22.619" style="s2">friends and go home. Now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.859" end="00:12:23.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Uncle Sebastian. I just saw Lena&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.619" end="00:12:25.339" style="s2">sister, Evelyn. She&#39;s working as an</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.819" end="00:12:26.819" style="s2">escort here. I was going to drag her</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.339" end="00:12:28.139" style="s2">home before she disgraced our family.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.819" end="00:12:29.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn?</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.139" end="00:12:31.539" style="s2">Where is she?</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.859" end="00:12:32.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sh- Sh- She&#39;s in the fanciest VIP room</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.539" end="00:12:33.619" style="s2">at the end of the hall.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.619" end="00:12:37.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re sure?</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.619" end="00:12:37.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true. All three of us are.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.579" end="00:12:54.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.179" end="00:12:56.459" style="s2">Where is she?</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.259" end="00:12:58.819" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say Evelyn was in here?</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.459" end="00:13:00.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Sebastian, I swear I&#39;m not lying.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.819" end="00:13:01.819" style="s2">I saw her walk in with my own eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.539" end="00:13:02.419" style="s2">Arthur Sterling opened the door for her</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.819" end="00:13:04.899" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.419" end="00:13:04.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.899" end="00:13:10.059" style="s2">From this moment until your engagement</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.139" end="00:13:14.179" style="s2">party is over,</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.059" end="00:13:15.539" style="s2">you don&#39;t set foot outside Wilson Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.179" end="00:13:17.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.539" end="00:13:20.019" style="s2">I understand, Uncle Sebastian.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.379" end="00:13:20.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.219" end="00:13:28.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you find out who&#39;s been looking into</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.499" end="00:13:30.539" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.299" end="00:13:32.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The IP address traces overseas, but it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.539" end="00:13:35.459" style="s2">heavily masked.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.139" end="00:13:38.539" style="s2">Our tech team doesn&#39;t have a lead yet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.459" end="00:13:38.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take a look myself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.699" end="00:13:53.619" style="s2">Nova.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.219" end="00:13:53.619" style="s2">Let me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.259" end="00:13:59.379" style="s2">Whoever&#39;s investigating you is careful</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.859" end="00:14:00.939" style="s2">and very good.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.379" end="00:14:03.859" style="s2">We&#39;ve tried tracing him several times,</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.939" end="00:14:06.499" style="s2">but he keeps leading us into traps.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.859" end="00:14:06.499" style="s2">He&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.699" end="00:14:11.819" style="s2">Yes. That&#39;s why you&#39;re the best hacker</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.819" end="00:14:12.819" style="s2">in the world. You spotted his trap and</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.819" end="00:14:15.459" style="s2">still broke straight through his</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.819" end="00:14:15.459" style="s2">firewalls.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.939" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">What happened? Did we lose the signal?</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.901" end="00:14:24.781" style="s2">He knew we&#39;d breach the firewall, so he</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.581" end="00:14:26.141" style="s2">physically destroyed the hard drive.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.781" end="00:14:28.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trail&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.141" end="00:14:29.901" style="s2">Know who it was?</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.101" end="00:14:32.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.901" end="00:14:33.221" style="s2">I know who it was.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.181" end="00:14:36.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.221" end="00:14:38.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our old enemy. Dark Sun&#39;s godfather,</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.221" end="00:14:38.981" style="s2">Overlord.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.021" end="00:14:45.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really was him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.701" end="00:14:47.541" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Overlord is just a code name.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.741" end="00:14:50.861" style="s2">I don&#39;t know his real identity,</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.541" end="00:14:51.941" style="s2">his name, or even what he looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.861" end="00:14:53.781" style="s2">But he probably didn&#39;t build that</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.941" end="00:14:54.941" style="s2">firewall himself.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.781" end="00:14:57.061" style="s2">Otherwise, I wouldn&#39;t have cracked it so</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.941" end="00:14:59.501" style="s2">fast.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.061" end="00:15:01.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably one of Dark Sun&#39;s people.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.501" end="00:15:03.461" style="s2">Half of the world&#39;s top 10 hackers work</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.061" end="00:15:05.261" style="s2">for them.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.461" end="00:15:06.541" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lately, his criminal empire has been</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.261" end="00:15:07.861" style="s2">coming after Black Stellar for no</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.541" end="00:15:09.901" style="s2">reason.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.861" end="00:15:11.421" style="s2">Once I unmask him, I&#39;ll tear him limb to</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.901" end="00:15:12.661" style="s2">limb.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.421" end="00:15:15.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wouldn&#39;t be surprising if this were</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.661" end="00:15:16.741" style="s2">just an old grudge with Black Stellar.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.181" end="00:15:18.061" style="s2">But now he&#39;s investigating your civilian</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.741" end="00:15:20.261" style="s2">identity.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.061" end="00:15:23.261" style="s2">Evelyn, Nova.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.261" end="00:15:23.261" style="s2">Do you think he suspects you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.741" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I doubt it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.181" end="00:15:29.981" style="s2">You&#39;re the only ones who know who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.501" end="00:15:31.261" style="s2">Still, we need to be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.981" end="00:15:32.941" style="s2">Ruby,</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.261" end="00:15:34.741" style="s2">build me a new cover identity. I want it</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.941" end="00:15:36.301" style="s2">airtight down to the smallest detail.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.741" end="00:15:37.701" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.301" end="00:15:39.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.701" end="00:15:41.901" style="s2">The Wilsons want to develop a next-gen</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.421" end="00:15:43.701" style="s2">chip with Orion Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.901" end="00:15:44.941" style="s2">Do we work with them?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:46.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.941" end="00:15:48.141" style="s2">But the terms still need work.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.701" end="00:15:49.581" style="s2">Hold off until I give the word.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.141" end="00:15:52.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.581" end="00:15:52.981" style="s2">Boss, our watchers downstairs confirmed</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.101" end="00:15:54.781" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.981" end="00:15:57.981" style="s2">Someone entered this room, and they</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.781" end="00:16:01.221" style="s2">never came out the front door.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.981" end="00:16:02.301" style="s2">A person doesn&#39;t just vanish.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.221" end="00:16:05.381" style="s2">Could there be some kind of hidden</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.301" end="00:16:05.381" style="s2">passage in this room?</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.221" end="00:16:14.861" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.221" end="00:16:14.861" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.781" end="00:16:20.342" style="s2">What is it, boss?</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.101" end="00:16:21.622" style="s2">Someone breached Dark Sun&#39;s firewall. I</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.342" end="00:16:23.382" style="s2">need to get back and re-encrypt the core</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.622" end="00:16:24.902" style="s2">data. If they trace the breach, they</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.382" end="00:16:26.022" style="s2">could uncover my identity.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.902" end="00:16:28.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I messed up, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.022" end="00:16:29.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t on you. Nova did it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.182" end="00:16:31.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nova?</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.622" end="00:16:32.622" style="s2">The world&#39;s top hacker and leader of</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.022" end="00:16:34.382" style="s2">Black Stellar?</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.622" end="00:16:37.102" style="s2">We were investigating Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.382" end="00:16:39.542" style="s2">Why would Nova intervene?</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.102" end="00:16:40.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what doesn&#39;t add up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.542" end="00:16:42.342" style="s2">A month ago,</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.822" end="00:16:45.582" style="s2">we escorted Professor Van Dyke to</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.342" end="00:16:47.062" style="s2">Elysium to acquire rare materials.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.582" end="00:16:49.182" style="s2">Black Stellar attacked and triggered a</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.062" end="00:16:50.622" style="s2">massive riot.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.182" end="00:16:51.862" style="s2">If an old friend hadn&#39;t happened to save</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.622" end="00:16:54.102" style="s2">the professor,</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.862" end="00:16:55.662" style="s2">the mission would have failed.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.102" end="00:16:57.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.662" end="00:16:59.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was close.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.862" end="00:17:01.222" style="s2">That&#39;s why I&#39;ve kept my eye on them ever</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.062" end="00:17:03.542" style="s2">since.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.222" end="00:17:04.902" style="s2">Whenever Black Stellar takes a job,</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.542" end="00:17:06.262" style="s2">I do everything I can to stop them and</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.902" end="00:17:08.782" style="s2">ruin it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.262" end="00:17:08.782" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.262" end="00:17:13.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough for tonight. If anything</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.102" end="00:17:14.942" style="s2">happens, call me on the encrypted line.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.342" end="00:17:17.622" style="s2">I&#39;m heading back.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.942" end="00:17:17.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, Nova.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.062" end="00:17:27.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.542" end="00:17:32.102" style="s2">I swear I saw Evelyn at this club. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.702" end="00:17:32.102" style="s2">true. She was unbelievably gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.062" end="00:17:36.902" style="s2">I took a picture from across the room.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.862" end="00:17:39.142" style="s2">Look for yourself if you don&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.902" end="00:17:39.142" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.822" end="00:17:50.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.342" end="00:17:50.182" style="s2">Someone was here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.262" end="00:17:55.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.522" end="00:17:57.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.782" end="00:18:00.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn is sweet and obedient. She&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.782" end="00:18:02.902" style="s2">never dress like this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.222" end="00:18:03.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You barely know her, Uncle Sebastian.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.902" end="00:18:06.542" style="s2">How do you know she&#39;s really that</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.902" end="00:18:06.542" style="s2">innocent?</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.182" end="00:18:10.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was trafficked to Elysium and spent</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.862" end="00:18:11.822" style="s2">7 years there.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.502" end="00:18:12.902" style="s2">Maybe she used to be a good girl, but</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.822" end="00:18:15.102" style="s2">after everything she went through, who</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.902" end="00:18:16.902" style="s2">knows what she&#39;s become?</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.102" end="00:18:19.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you enjoy smearing your former fiance</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.902" end="00:18:19.502" style="s2">this much?</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.462" end="00:18:24.703" style="s2">There&#39;s an easy way to settle this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.063" end="00:18:25.743" style="s2">Check where she was today. Then we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.703" end="00:18:26.783" style="s2">know if she came to this club.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.743" end="00:18:28.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.783" end="00:18:31.783" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you embarrassed yourself enough?</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.423" end="00:18:31.783" style="s2">Go home now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.943" end="00:18:37.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Sebastian, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.303" end="00:18:44.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step on it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.623" end="00:18:45.263" style="s2">Get us back to Wilson Manor now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.103" end="00:18:47.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.263" end="00:18:50.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, if you&#39;re not in that room,</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.663" end="00:18:50.383" style="s2">you&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.503" end="00:18:58.183" style="s2">Where&#39;s Evelyn?</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.863" end="00:19:02.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Miss Evelyn hasn&#39;t left her room</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.943" end="00:19:05.623" style="s2">since she went in.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.343" end="00:19:05.623" style="s2">She should be asleep by now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.823" end="00:19:12.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.583" end="00:19:14.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.183" end="00:19:14.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.143" end="00:19:24.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.183" end="00:19:25.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I ran into some trouble. I was making</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.423" end="00:19:28.263" style="s2">sure you were safe.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.703" end="00:19:30.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. I I was asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.263" end="00:19:31.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, get some rest. What am I even</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.823" end="00:19:34.063" style="s2">thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.863" end="00:19:35.903" style="s2">She&#39;s a sweet, obedient girl. She</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.063" end="00:19:38.583" style="s2">couldn&#39;t possibly be that wild, ruthless</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.903" end="00:19:38.583" style="s2">lunatic.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.008" end="00:20:02.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.863" end="00:20:03.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was a close call. Thank god I cut</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.103" end="00:20:04.983" style="s2">through the back.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.903" end="00:20:06.783" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.983" end="00:20:09.343" style="s2">He left the house.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.783" end="00:20:12.343" style="s2">Why did he suddenly come check my room?</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.343" end="00:20:12.343" style="s2">Did he spot something?</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.063" end="00:20:18.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, looks like Miss Evelyn really was</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.983" end="00:20:22.023" style="s2">asleep the whole time. The woman Kevin</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.943" end="00:20:22.023" style="s2">saw at the club wasn&#39;t her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.903" end="00:20:26.385" style="s2">Boss, we found Evelyn&#39;s records. Seven</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.065" end="00:20:28.145" style="s2">years ago, after she ended up on</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.385" end="00:20:30.025" style="s2">Elysium&#39;s black market, an elderly</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.145" end="00:20:31.865" style="s2">couple from the slums took her in. They</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.025" end="00:20:33.785" style="s2">survived by scavenging and both died in</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.865" end="00:20:35.865" style="s2">an accident last month. Then Richard</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.785" end="00:20:37.065" style="s2">Bloom had her legal identity erased.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.865" end="00:20:38.705" style="s2">That&#39;s why she had to fight so hard to</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.065" end="00:20:40.225" style="s2">get home.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.705" end="00:20:43.225" style="s2">The Nova&#39;s move last night was probably</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.225" end="00:20:43.225" style="s2">just a coincidence.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.585" end="00:20:54.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir. Mr. Wilson, Kevin.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.505" end="00:20:55.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.105" end="00:20:57.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your uncle saw the Blooms throw Miss</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.745" end="00:20:59.745" style="s2">Evelyn out yesterday. She had nowhere</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.905" end="00:21:02.545" style="s2">else to go, so he invited her to stay</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.745" end="00:21:02.545" style="s2">here for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.025" end="00:21:08.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Sebastian invited her?</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.945" end="00:21:09.145" style="s2">He never lets women stay at Wilson</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.305" end="00:21:10.825" style="s2">Manor. Why would he</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.145" end="00:21:13.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time I saw you, you barely came up</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.825" end="00:21:14.025" style="s2">this high. Now look at you, all grown</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.065" end="00:21:16.025" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.025" end="00:21:19.025" style="s2">Come sit beside me, Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.025" end="00:21:19.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Wilson.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.945" end="00:21:25.185" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve had a hard 7 years, haven&#39;t you,</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.505" end="00:21:26.825" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.185" end="00:21:28.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a few setbacks.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.825" end="00:21:28.665" style="s2">Hardship makes you stronger when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.025" end="00:21:30.745" style="s2">young.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.665" end="00:21:33.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? This is what a sensible young woman</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.745" end="00:21:35.545" style="s2">looks like. Kevin, learn something from</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.265" end="00:21:38.305" style="s2">Evelyn. All you do is party. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.545" end="00:21:40.905" style="s2">nothing but a spoiled deadbeat.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.305" end="00:21:42.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it, Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.905" end="00:21:43.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that you&#39;re home, Evelyn, what do</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.385" end="00:21:46.305" style="s2">you want to do next?</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.945" end="00:21:47.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to go back to school.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.305" end="00:21:48.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.505" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">Then finish your senior year at St.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.945" end="00:21:52.105" style="s2">Cross Academy. The Wilson family is a</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:53.825" style="s2">major donor.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.105" end="00:21:55.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; St. Cross Academy is exactly where I</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.825" end="00:21:57.425" style="s2">need to be. With the Wilsons arranging</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.825" end="00:21:59.345" style="s2">it, no one will question a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.425" end="00:22:01.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That would be wonderful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.345" end="00:22:04.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it&#39;s settled. Sebastian, arrange</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.625" end="00:22:05.425" style="s2">her enrollment.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.265" end="00:22:07.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Consider it done.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.425" end="00:22:08.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, that&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.345" end="00:22:10.745" style="s2">She was only 12 when she was trafficked</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.825" end="00:22:12.705" style="s2">to Elysian. You expect her to walk into</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.745" end="00:22:14.345" style="s2">senior year at St. Cross Academy? She&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.705" end="00:22:15.225" style="s2">never keep up. She&#39;ll embarrass the</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.345" end="00:22:16.985" style="s2">Wilson family.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.225" end="00:22:18.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Kevin. I&#39;ve been teaching</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.985" end="00:22:19.945" style="s2">myself all these years. I can handle the</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.905" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">exams.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.945" end="00:22:23.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teaching yourself? In a nightclub VIP</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.105" end="00:22:25.626" style="s2">room?</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.505" end="00:22:27.546" style="s2">I saw you at the Abyss last night.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.626" end="00:22:29.946" style="s2">You went into Orion Syndicate CEO Arthur</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.546" end="00:22:32.706" style="s2">Sterling&#39;s private VIP room.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.946" end="00:22:32.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The abyss?</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.346" end="00:22:39.346" style="s2">Is what Kevin said true?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.986" end="00:22:40.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin must have mistaken someone else</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.346" end="00:22:42.026" style="s2">for me. I haven&#39;t left my room since I</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.946" end="00:22:42.946" style="s2">arrived at Wilson Manor last</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.026" end="00:22:43.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying!</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.946" end="00:22:45.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.986" end="00:22:46.826" style="s2">Miss Evelyn didn&#39;t leave her room last</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.346" end="00:22:48.066" style="s2">night. Your uncle and I can both vouch</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.826" end="00:22:49.266" style="s2">for her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.066" end="00:22:50.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.266" end="00:22:51.146" style="s2">I know what I saw.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.146" end="00:22:52.746" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.146" end="00:22:54.026" style="s2">I&#39;m taking Evelyn to enroll at Saint</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.746" end="00:22:56.386" style="s2">Cross Academy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.026" end="00:23:00.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.386" end="00:23:02.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll excuse myself, Mr. Wilson.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.066" end="00:23:02.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.786" end="00:23:08.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, this sweet little act is fake!</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.466" end="00:23:10.586" style="s2">SHE TURNED AROUND AND GLARED AT ME.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.506" end="00:23:12.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ENOUGH. You broke the engagement and</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.586" end="00:23:13.706" style="s2">then went after her sister. You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.306" end="00:23:15.866" style="s2">one in the wrong and you&#39;ve still got</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.706" end="00:23:17.746" style="s2">the nerve to throw a tantrum.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.866" end="00:23:20.426" style="s2">We&#39;ve spoiled you rotten. You&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.746" end="00:23:22.666" style="s2">disgrace to the Wilson name.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.426" end="00:23:25.186" style="s2">Starting this month, your trust fund</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.666" end="00:23:26.386" style="s2">payout drops from a million dollars to a</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.186" end="00:23:27.946" style="s2">hundred grand.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.386" end="00:23:31.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Grandpa, please.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.946" end="00:23:32.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My decision is final.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.346" end="00:23:34.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena, you&#39;re Professor Van Dyke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.546" end="00:23:35.546" style="s2">handpicked protege. He&#39;s the biggest</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.306" end="00:23:37.386" style="s2">authority on advanced chips in the</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.546" end="00:23:39.266" style="s2">country. I also heard you applied for an</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.386" end="00:23:40.466" style="s2">internship at Orion Syndicate. Any news?</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.266" end="00:23:42.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With my family&#39;s connections and my</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.466" end="00:23:44.786" style="s2">credentials, the offer&#39;s as good as</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.346" end="00:23:44.786" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.626" end="00:23:48.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.706" end="00:23:50.826" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s the new transfer, apparently.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.946" end="00:23:53.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why, Lena? You know her?</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.826" end="00:23:55.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I know her. She&#39;s my half-sister.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.626" end="00:23:57.106" style="s2">She spent seven years being treated like</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.306" end="00:23:58.626" style="s2">livestock on a Legion&#39;s black market and</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.106" end="00:23:59.626" style="s2">now she has the nerve to show her face</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.626" end="00:24:02.746" style="s2">at an elite school like</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.626" end="00:24:02.746" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she&#39;s damaged goods.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.186" end="00:24:09.986" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.866" end="00:24:09.986" style="s2">I&#39;m going to ruin her.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.706" end="00:24:15.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, class A is our best. Class F</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.186" end="00:24:19.666" style="s2">is our worst.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.706" end="00:24:19.666" style="s2">I&#39;ll place Miss Evelyn in class A.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.946" end="00:24:23.106" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.426" end="00:24:25.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The person I&#39;m looking for is in class</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.106" end="00:24:28.266" style="s2">F.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.106" end="00:24:28.266" style="s2">How do I turn this down?</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.466" end="00:24:34.227" style="s2">Wait. Evelyn may be my sister, but she</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.187" end="00:24:35.747" style="s2">hasn&#39;t been in school for years. If you</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.227" end="00:24:38.187" style="s2">force her into class A and she can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.747" end="00:24:39.268" style="s2">keep up, she&#39;ll humiliate herself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.187" end="00:24:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.268" end="00:24:42.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.507" end="00:24:44.148" style="s2">My sweet little sister just handed me</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.028" end="00:24:45.547" style="s2">the perfect excuse for class F.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.148" end="00:24:46.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.547" end="00:24:48.347" style="s2">I&#39;ll go to class F.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.908" end="00:24:49.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure?</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.347" end="00:24:51.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.827" end="00:24:53.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then make it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.307" end="00:24:55.427" style="s2">She takes an insult like that without</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.067" end="00:24:57.427" style="s2">pushing back at all.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.427" end="00:25:00.187" style="s2">Evelyn really is as sweet and obedient</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.427" end="00:25:00.187" style="s2">as she looks.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.347" end="00:25:04.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Raise. I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.947" end="00:25:07.347" style="s2">Damn it. Show me your cards. How are you</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.547" end="00:25:07.347" style="s2">this lucky?</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.827" end="00:25:14.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quiet. Turn off the music.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.307" end="00:25:20.347" style="s2">We have a new student joining us today.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.987" end="00:25:20.347" style="s2">Let&#39;s give her a warm welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.668" end="00:25:30.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years and finally we meet</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.547" end="00:25:30.427" style="s2">again. Victoria, you traitor.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.028" end="00:25:34.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, there&#39;s an empty seat over</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.467" end="00:25:36.187" style="s2">there. Take it for now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.107" end="00:25:37.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harris.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.187" end="00:25:39.507" style="s2">Who&#39;s she?</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.347" end="00:25:41.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria is the top student in class F</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.507" end="00:25:43.587" style="s2">with a character to match. Seven years</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.547" end="00:25:45.467" style="s2">ago during the Elysian trafficking case</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.587" end="00:25:47.627" style="s2">that shocked the country, she escaped</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.467" end="00:25:49.307" style="s2">through sheer courage and intelligence.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.627" end="00:25:51.747" style="s2">The mayor personally awarded her the</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.307" end="00:25:53.627" style="s2">Star of Courage medal.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.747" end="00:25:55.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Star of Courage?</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.627" end="00:25:57.662" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t deserve it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.642" end="00:25:57.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.148" end="00:26:02.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shh. Don&#39;t cry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.307" end="00:26:03.268" style="s2">Do you all want to get out of here</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.307" end="00:26:05.028" style="s2">alive?</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.268" end="00:26:08.388" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, but there are armed guards</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.028" end="00:26:09.707" style="s2">everywhere. How can we escape?</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.388" end="00:26:11.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I memorized the entire route when they</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.707" end="00:26:13.507" style="s2">brought me in. The guards change shifts</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.587" end="00:26:15.307" style="s2">every 2 hours and there&#39;s a 5-minute gap</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.507" end="00:26:16.908" style="s2">with no one watching.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.307" end="00:26:18.707" style="s2">It&#39;s dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.908" end="00:26:20.028" style="s2">But if we don&#39;t try, we all know what&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.707" end="00:26:21.107" style="s2">happen when tomorrow night&#39;s auction</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.028" end="00:26:25.227" style="s2">starts.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.107" end="00:26:25.227" style="s2">So, are you willing to risk it?</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.668" end="00:26:26.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.347" end="00:26:28.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.947" end="00:26:30.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Lie down and pretend to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.867" end="00:26:32.949" style="s2">Save your strength. We move when you</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.189" end="00:26:32.949" style="s2">hear my signal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.669" end="00:26:44.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing out here, you little</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.789" end="00:26:46.189" style="s2">brat? Get back inside.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.109" end="00:26:50.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t hit me. I&#39;ll tell you something.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.189" end="00:26:50.029" style="s2">Someone&#39;s planning to escape tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.429" end="00:26:59.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say someone&#39;s planning an escape?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.418" end="00:27:08.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.383" end="00:27:10.909" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.309" end="00:27:12.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We made it this far. We&#39;re safe for now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.909" end="00:27:14.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.869" end="00:27:17.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.149" end="00:27:17.749" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t gotten us out,</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.029" end="00:27:22.429" style="s2">God knows what they would have done to</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.509" end="00:27:22.429" style="s2">us tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.149" end="00:27:30.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little rats really thought you could</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.829" end="00:27:35.189" style="s2">escape Elysian?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.709" end="00:27:35.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. There&#39;s a traitor among us.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.749" end="00:27:45.349" style="s2">Victoria,</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.029" end="00:27:49.029" style="s2">have we met before?</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.349" end="00:27:49.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you just look familiar.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.589" end="00:27:56.469" style="s2">No wonder she looks familiar. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.629" end="00:27:56.469" style="s2">Lena&#39;s long-lost half-sister.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.509" end="00:28:00.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sold on Elysian&#39;s black market for 7</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.829" end="00:28:01.669" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.189" end="00:28:02.949" style="s2">Who knows what diseases she picked up</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.669" end="00:28:06.069" style="s2">there?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.949" end="00:28:07.989" style="s2">She puts on this sweet, innocent act,</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.069" end="00:28:11.189" style="s2">but for all we know, she might have even</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.989" end="00:28:11.189" style="s2">had a kid in the slums.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.884" end="00:28:15.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.669" end="00:28:17.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she came out of the black market?</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.229" end="00:28:20.229" style="s2">She disappeared for 7 years, then</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.189" end="00:28:20.229" style="s2">crawled back in here?</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.189" end="00:28:25.909" style="s2">She&#39;s filthy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.389" end="00:28:28.914" style="s2">Class F may be the bottom of the roll,</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.909" end="00:28:29.309" style="s2">but even we don&#39;t want trash like her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.914" end="00:28:31.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.309" end="00:28:34.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.069" end="00:28:37.030" style="s2">If being kidnapped makes someone dirty,</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.270" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t that apply to Victoria, too?</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.030" end="00:28:40.049" style="s2">How come she gets to sit here like</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.310" end="00:28:42.014" style="s2">nothing happened?</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.049" end="00:28:42.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.014" end="00:28:44.270" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.430" end="00:28:47.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you dare compare yourself to</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.270" end="00:28:48.470" style="s2">Victoria. She escaped almost the second</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.030" end="00:28:51.230" style="s2">they took her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.470" end="00:28:52.510" style="s2">Because she&#39;s actually smart.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.230" end="00:28:54.550" style="s2">You?</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.510" end="00:28:57.230" style="s2">You rotted away in that hell for 7</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.550" end="00:28:59.550" style="s2">years. A total loser.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.230" end="00:29:01.710" style="s2">Exactly. The mayor personally honored</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.550" end="00:29:04.990" style="s2">Victoria. She&#39;s beautiful, kind, and</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.710" end="00:29:04.990" style="s2">brilliant. What are you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.310" end="00:29:09.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.470" end="00:29:10.950" style="s2">She&#39;s a victim, too.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.470" end="00:29:13.830" style="s2">How can you say something that cruel to</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.950" end="00:29:13.830" style="s2">a classmate?</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.070" end="00:29:18.910" style="s2">Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.710" end="00:29:20.070" style="s2">come with me to the office.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.910" end="00:29:22.630" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you the syllabus for this</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.070" end="00:29:22.630" style="s2">semester.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.790" end="00:29:25.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. [music] Harris.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.190" end="00:29:36.870" style="s2">She really spent 7 years on Elysium&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.070" end="00:29:39.000" style="s2">black market? Lena told me herself. Why</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.870" end="00:29:40.310" style="s2">would she lie?</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.000" end="00:29:41.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.310" end="00:29:42.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two were taken at the same time,</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.710" end="00:29:46.030" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.710" end="00:29:46.030" style="s2">You never saw her on Elysium?</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.270" end="00:29:50.870" style="s2">There were tons of girls there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.390" end="00:29:52.430" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t have seen every one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.870" end="00:29:54.190" style="s2">But you were right.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.430" end="00:29:57.590" style="s2">Trash that crawled out of the slums has</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.190" end="00:29:57.590" style="s2">no business in our class.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.150" end="00:30:01.110" style="s2">So, what are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.510" end="00:30:05.230" style="s2">I&#39;ll find a way to get her kicked out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.470" end="00:30:17.790" style="s2">Cute. You&#39;re dying for a fight?</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.270" end="00:30:20.270" style="s2">Fine. I&#39;ll play your game.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.790" end="00:30:24.190" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, are you blind?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.270" end="00:30:24.190" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I didn&#39;t mean to.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.030" end="00:30:31.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone take your seats. Books out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.830" end="00:30:31.790" style="s2">Class is starting.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.750" end="00:30:39.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harris, my textbook was Mr. Harris,</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.392" end="00:30:41.512" style="s2">my textbook got stained somehow and</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.472" end="00:30:43.592" style="s2">Chloe offered to swap hers with mine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.512" end="00:30:45.392" style="s2">She&#39;s so sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.592" end="00:30:46.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.392" end="00:30:47.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.712" end="00:30:51.051" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.952" end="00:30:51.432" style="s2">you&#39;re the one who ruined my book.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.051" end="00:30:52.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.432" end="00:30:54.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.992" end="00:30:56.632" style="s2">Just keep mine for now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.752" end="00:30:58.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I hope the rest of you follow</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.632" end="00:31:01.552" style="s2">Chloe&#39;s example. Get ready. Class starts</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.952" end="00:31:01.552" style="s2">in a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.272" end="00:31:06.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, don&#39;t get smart with me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.272" end="00:31:19.912" style="s2">Idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.872" end="00:31:25.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Chloe,</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.512" end="00:31:28.351" style="s2">how clumsy of you. Should I go get the</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.632" end="00:31:28.351" style="s2">school nurse?</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.072" end="00:31:35.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] I&#39;LL KILL YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.392" end="00:31:41.352" style="s2">GOD, THAT HURTS. LET GO.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.176" end="00:31:42.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.352" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CHLOE, what are you doing? Were you</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.872" end="00:31:48.112" style="s2">trying to kill me? My hand, you&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.112" end="00:31:48.112" style="s2">freaking devil.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.691" end="00:31:51.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.346" end="00:31:51.367" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.392" end="00:31:55.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, it&#39;s your first day and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.432" end="00:31:57.552" style="s2">already attacking people. Class F</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.632" end="00:31:58.752" style="s2">doesn&#39;t tolerate violence. Just wait</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.552" end="00:32:00.752" style="s2">till the school expels you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.752" end="00:32:02.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, don&#39;t twist what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.752" end="00:32:03.832" style="s2">Chloe attacked me first. I only fought</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.592" end="00:32:07.552" style="s2">back because I was scared.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.832" end="00:32:07.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, we all saw it. Chloe started it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.872" end="00:32:11.552" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.992" end="00:32:17.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harris, Chloe threw coffee at me and</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.512" end="00:32:19.231" style="s2">then tried to kill me. If I hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.952" end="00:32:23.752" style="s2">dodged, I&#39;D BE DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.231" end="00:32:25.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S [ __ ] You broke my wrist.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.752" end="00:32:27.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, you attacked me first and now</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.792" end="00:32:30.712" style="s2">you&#39;re accusing me of breaking your</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.072" end="00:32:34.632" style="s2">wrist. Fine, let&#39;s call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.712" end="00:32:34.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, we don&#39;t need the police.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.507" end="00:32:38.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.817" end="00:32:41.993" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.032" end="00:32:41.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harris, I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.913" end="00:32:47.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, that&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.673" end="00:32:57.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harris, look.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.473" end="00:32:59.633" style="s2">She said I broke her wrist, but she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.833" end="00:33:01.953" style="s2">moving it just fine. She made the whole</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.633" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">thing up to frame me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.953" end="00:33:06.073" style="s2">It&#39;s It&#39;s fine? Mr. Harris, I swear it</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:06.833" style="s2">was broken a second ago. It hurt so bad</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.073" end="00:33:09.513" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t move it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.833" end="00:33:09.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.353" end="00:33:12.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harris, she&#39;s bullying me in front</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.473" end="00:33:14.593" style="s2">of the whole class. The school is going</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.593" end="00:33:15.593" style="s2">to do something, right? If it won&#39;t, I</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.593" end="00:33:16.713" style="s2">guess I&#39;ll have to specifically told me</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.593" end="00:33:17.393" style="s2">this morning to report anything that</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.713" end="00:33:19.353" style="s2">happened to me here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.393" end="00:33:21.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian Wilson is brutal.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.353" end="00:33:23.633" style="s2">If he learns his protégé got victimized</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.033" end="00:33:25.473" style="s2">in my class, I&#39;ll lose my job. I could</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.633" end="00:33:26.753" style="s2">even end up dead. Of course the school</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.473" end="00:33:28.513" style="s2">will act.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.753" end="00:33:30.073" style="s2">And we&#39;ll get to the bottom of this.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.513" end="00:33:31.753" style="s2">Chloe, you publicly bullied a new</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.073" end="00:33:34.073" style="s2">student and seriously violated school</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.753" end="00:33:34.793" style="s2">policy. You can expect to be expelled.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.073" end="00:33:37.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.793" end="00:33:39.113" style="s2">you can&#39;t expel me. My dad will kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.073" end="00:33:40.673" style="s2">Evelyn, please give me one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.113" end="00:33:42.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not that I won&#39;t forgive you. We</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.673" end="00:33:44.633" style="s2">only met today. You can&#39;t possibly hate</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.553" end="00:33:46.433" style="s2">me this much. If someone put you up to</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.633" end="00:33:47.793" style="s2">it, just tell us. If you&#39;re not the one</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.433" end="00:33:50.073" style="s2">behind this, I won&#39;t hold it against</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.793" end="00:33:50.073" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.513" end="00:33:55.753" style="s2">Why are you looking at me? I never told</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.873" end="00:33:58.233" style="s2">you to bully her.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.753" end="00:34:01.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made me do it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.233" end="00:34:01.393" style="s2">I&#39;LL KILL [screaming] YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.193" end="00:34:06.953" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, BOTH OF YOU, STOP IT.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.243" end="00:34:07.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.953" end="00:34:09.753" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YEAH, I THOUGHT VICTORIA WAS THIS</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.993" end="00:34:10.953" style="s2">BEAUTIFUL, kind angel. Turns out she was</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.753" end="00:34:11.873" style="s2">pulling Chloe&#39;s strings the whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.953" end="00:34:15.513" style="s2">That&#39;s disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.873" end="00:34:15.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a total textbook two-faced MEAN</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.593" end="00:34:22.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STEP ONE,</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.833" end="00:34:26.473" style="s2">I&#39;M RIPPING OFF HER FAKE mask and</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.633" end="00:34:26.473" style="s2">exposing her true vicious side.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.113" end="00:34:36.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s only been 15 minutes. She&#39;s turning</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.713" end="00:34:37.913" style="s2">it in already?</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.713" end="00:34:40.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She probably didn&#39;t know all the answers</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.913" end="00:34:42.034" style="s2">and just guessed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.273" end="00:34:42.794" style="s2">Mr. Harris, I&#39;m finished. Can I leave</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.034" end="00:34:44.354" style="s2">early?</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.794" end="00:34:46.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, you can go.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.354" end="00:34:48.164" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Harris.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.794" end="00:34:48.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like Lena was right.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.164" end="00:34:49.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.314" end="00:34:53.404" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s only at St. Cross Academy to</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.794" end="00:34:55.424" style="s2">coast. She doesn&#39;t know a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.404" end="00:34:55.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.954" end="00:35:04.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, did she play us yesterday?</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.634" end="00:35:06.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just figuring that out?</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.674" end="00:35:08.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t matter. At St. Cross Academy,</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.674" end="00:35:10.354" style="s2">grades are what count. When the scores</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.594" end="00:35:12.154" style="s2">come out and she gets a zero, I&#39;ll blast</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.354" end="00:35:15.634" style="s2">it all over the school forum. The board</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.154" end="00:35:15.634" style="s2">will have no choice but to expel her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.294" end="00:35:20.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.394" end="00:35:25.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.114" end="00:35:29.074" style="s2">Every answer is right.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.954" end="00:35:29.074" style="s2">How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.314" end="00:35:35.674" style="s2">I heard you didn&#39;t come back to the</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.314" end="00:35:36.914" style="s2">manor last night. Where were you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.674" end="00:35:38.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been away from the Bloom family so</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.914" end="00:35:39.314" style="s2">long, I forgot the way home. So, I found</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.114" end="00:35:40.554" style="s2">a hotel for the night. If that reflects</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.314" end="00:35:40.914" style="s2">badly on the family, I can move back in</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.554" end="00:35:42.634" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.914" end="00:35:44.434" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. You haven&#39;t lived here in 7</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.634" end="00:35:46.074" style="s2">years. There&#39;s no way you&#39;d adjust to</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.434" end="00:35:47.594" style="s2">the Bloom family&#39;s rules now. These are</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.074" end="00:35:50.194" style="s2">your identity papers. With them, you can</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.594" end="00:35:54.034" style="s2">go anywhere you want.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.194" end="00:35:54.034" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Dad. I&#39;ll move out today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.634" end="00:36:00.194" style="s2">Dad, Mom, I got an official internship</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.594" end="00:36:02.114" style="s2">offer from the Orion Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.194" end="00:36:03.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Orion Syndicate? It&#39;s the world&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.114" end="00:36:04.954" style="s2">most valuable tech conglomerate.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.714" end="00:36:05.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena, you make me so proud. Not like</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.954" end="00:36:06.554" style="s2">that street kid who&#39;s 7 years in the</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.994" end="00:36:08.674" style="s2">slums.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.554" end="00:36:10.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Mom, today she actually had</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.674" end="00:36:11.634" style="s2">the nerve to beg Uncle Sebastian to pull</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.234" end="00:36:13.474" style="s2">strings and put her in the senior class</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.634" end="00:36:15.194" style="s2">at St. Cross Academy. She doesn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.474" end="00:36:17.274" style="s2">anything. It&#39;s humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.194" end="00:36:18.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget her. Lena, I heard your paper on</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.274" end="00:36:20.634" style="s2">chip optimization made it to Professor</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.674" end="00:36:21.834" style="s2">Van Dyke. If he endorses you, MIT will</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.634" end="00:36:23.314" style="s2">make an exception and admit you on the</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.834" end="00:36:24.474" style="s2">spot. You won&#39;t even have to take the</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.314" end="00:36:26.514" style="s2">entrance exam, right?</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.474" end="00:36:29.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.514" end="00:36:29.714" style="s2">Professor Van Dyke?</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.000" end="00:36:33.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.594" end="00:36:36.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It works.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.914" end="00:36:37.994" style="s2">This is brilliant. I&#39;ve spent years on</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.114" end="00:36:38.994" style="s2">this. How did I never think of deriving</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.994" end="00:36:40.994" style="s2">it this way?</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.994" end="00:36:42.834" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor, I&#39;d like to call this</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.994" end="00:36:44.234" style="s2">deduction model</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.834" end="00:36:45.436" style="s2">T theory.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.234" end="00:36:47.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.436" end="00:36:49.636" style="s2">Evelyn, you&#39;re a true genius, but this</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.676" end="00:36:50.836" style="s2">theory is far ahead of its time.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.636" end="00:36:52.596" style="s2">Publishing it now could bring you</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.836" end="00:36:53.925" style="s2">trouble you don&#39;t need. I&#39;ll file the</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.596" end="00:36:53.956" style="s2">patent for you first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.925" end="00:36:55.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.956" end="00:36:56.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the time is right, we&#39;ll show it to</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.636" end="00:37:00.036" style="s2">the world.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.996" end="00:37:00.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Professor.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.516" end="00:37:10.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rick Dawson, your time&#39;s up. Get out</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.916" end="00:37:12.796" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.236" end="00:37:16.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nova, drop the gun. Move 1 in and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.796" end="00:37:16.436" style="s2">blow this old man&#39;s brains out.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.276" end="00:37:21.836" style="s2">He&#39;s America&#39;s foremost chip expert. If</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.676" end="00:37:24.956" style="s2">he dies because of you, THE WHOLE WORLD</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.836" end="00:37:24.956" style="s2">WILL COME AFTER YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.676" end="00:37:29.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You talk too much.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.876" end="00:37:32.956" style="s2">Professor Van Dyke.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.956" end="00:37:34.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.956" end="00:37:35.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.596" end="00:37:37.476" style="s2">Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.676" end="00:37:38.796" style="s2">Theory, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.476" end="00:37:41.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.796" end="00:37:42.316" style="s2">You vanished. How did you</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.076" end="00:37:44.236" style="s2">end up like this?</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.316" end="00:37:45.956" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll explain everything later. For now,</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.236" end="00:37:46.676" style="s2">Professor, you need to keep my identity</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.956" end="00:37:49.076" style="s2">secret.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.676" end="00:37:50.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. You have my word.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.076" end="00:37:53.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still have a mission to finish. I have</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.676" end="00:37:53.076" style="s2">to go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.916" end="00:38:05.276" style="s2">Professor, are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.636" end="00:38:06.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An old friend saved me. Otherwise, these</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.276" end="00:38:07.636" style="s2">old bones of mine would have been buried</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.636" end="00:38:08.396" style="s2">on Elysian today.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.636" end="00:38:09.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An old friend?</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.396" end="00:38:10.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We have the rare material. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.916" end="00:38:12.556" style="s2">get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.556" end="00:38:14.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. Let&#39;s move.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.556" end="00:38:17.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, the Professor made it out safely</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.276" end="00:38:17.996" style="s2">after I rescued him last month.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.556" end="00:38:24.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn?</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.716" end="00:38:25.476" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor Van Dyke.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.356" end="00:38:26.796" style="s2">It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.476" end="00:38:28.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you finally went home to the</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.796" end="00:38:29.156" style="s2">Blooms.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.036" end="00:38:31.396" style="s2">I called because there&#39;s something</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.156" end="00:38:33.836" style="s2">important I need to confirm.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.396" end="00:38:35.316" style="s2">That T, the theory you developed 8 years</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.836" end="00:38:38.716" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.316" end="00:38:38.716" style="s2">Did anyone else knew about it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.076" end="00:38:45.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.196" end="00:38:47.157" style="s2">After I finished the model, I kept the</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.636" end="00:38:48.437" style="s2">manuscript in my bedroom at the Bloom</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.157" end="00:38:50.517" style="s2">estate.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.437" end="00:38:52.157" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then that explains it. A student is</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.517" end="00:38:54.157" style="s2">claiming she developed the theory and is</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.157" end="00:38:55.997" style="s2">filing a patent for it. I looked into</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.157" end="00:38:57.917" style="s2">her background. She&#39;s your stepmother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.997" end="00:38:59.397" style="s2">daughter, Lena Bloom.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.917" end="00:39:00.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, it was her.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.397" end="00:39:03.117" style="s2">No wonder she&#39;s been parading around</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.677" end="00:39:04.997" style="s2">West Coast society as some girl genius.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.117" end="00:39:07.357" style="s2">Now I know where the title came from.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.997" end="00:39:10.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Academic fraud disgusts me, and you</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.357" end="00:39:11.037" style="s2">saved my life. Leave this to me. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.037" end="00:39:14.237" style="s2">handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.037" end="00:39:14.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll leave it to you, Professor.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.797" end="00:39:18.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this garbage? You expect this to</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.677" end="00:39:21.957" style="s2">win an exclusive deal with the Orion</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.117" end="00:39:21.957" style="s2">Syndicate? Take it back and redo it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.797" end="00:39:26.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.077" end="00:39:29.117" style="s2">Uncle Sebastian, we don&#39;t have to make</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.997" end="00:39:30.677" style="s2">this so complicated. I have the perfect</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.117" end="00:39:31.397" style="s2">way into the Orion Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.677" end="00:39:34.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.397" end="00:39:35.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. But, if I pull it off,</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.277" end="00:39:36.237" style="s2">will you end my house arrest and let me</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.477" end="00:39:36.917" style="s2">go out?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.237" end="00:39:38.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.917" end="00:39:40.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. It&#39;s all thanks to Lena. Her</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.997" end="00:39:41.837" style="s2">internship application was approved, and</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.717" end="00:39:43.837" style="s2">she starts at the Orion Syndicate</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.837" end="00:39:45.917" style="s2">tomorrow. With her on the inside, she</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.837" end="00:39:46.917" style="s2">can set up a partnership meeting. Hell,</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.917" end="00:39:49.957" style="s2">getting us face time with their</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.917" end="00:39:51.077" style="s2">mysterious CEO, Arthur, will be easy.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.957" end="00:39:52.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.077" end="00:39:54.237" style="s2">Handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.357" end="00:39:55.997" style="s2">If you deliver, I&#39;ll lift the limit on</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.237" end="00:39:57.757" style="s2">your credit cards, too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.997" end="00:40:00.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Uncle Sebastian. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.757" end="00:40:00.637" style="s2">see Lila right now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.037" end="00:40:09.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s Evelyn doing?</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.677" end="00:40:11.597" style="s2">Her grades aren&#39;t great, so hire a few</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.077" end="00:40:13.957" style="s2">more tutors for her.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.597" end="00:40:13.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.357" end="00:40:18.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. Mr. Harris?</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.877" end="00:40:28.757" style="s2">You&#39;re saying Evelyn took an exam</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.557" end="00:40:30.357" style="s2">and got every answer right?</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.757" end="00:40:32.517" style="s2">And the school wants to fast-track her</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.357" end="00:40:35.437" style="s2">into this year&#39;s AMC qualifiers and the</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.517" end="00:40:35.437" style="s2">USAMO?</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.957" end="00:40:40.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t add up. If she spent 7</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.717" end="00:40:42.557" style="s2">years in the slums on Elixia, she would</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.917" end="00:40:44.397" style="s2">have no access to advanced education.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.557" end="00:40:45.477" style="s2">Saint Cross Academy exams are brutal.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.397" end="00:40:48.677" style="s2">Even I have trouble getting a perfect</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.477" end="00:40:49.678" style="s2">score. How did she do it? Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.677" end="00:40:51.918" style="s2">This is all the security footage of</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.678" end="00:40:52.838" style="s2">Evelyn did at school today. A few words</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.918" end="00:40:53.718" style="s2">and she turned Victoria and Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.838" end="00:40:54.678" style="s2">against each other while walking away</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.718" end="00:40:55.758" style="s2">the winner.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.678" end="00:40:57.078" style="s2">Seems she&#39;s not quite as sweet as we</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.758" end="00:40:58.158" style="s2">thought.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.078" end="00:41:00.558" style="s2">Seems she&#39;s not quite as sweet as we</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.158" end="00:41:00.558" style="s2">thought.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.078" end="00:41:05.358" style="s2">Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.078" end="00:41:06.478" style="s2">perfect timing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.358" end="00:41:07.878" style="s2">Care to explain what happened at school</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.478" end="00:41:10.478" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.878" end="00:41:11.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, are you blaming me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.478" end="00:41:13.758" style="s2">They bullied me first. I only fought</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.838" end="00:41:15.998" style="s2">back because I had no choice.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.758" end="00:41:17.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not blaming you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.998" end="00:41:20.398" style="s2">This just isn&#39;t like the sweet, obedient</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.718" end="00:41:23.118" style="s2">girl you usually are.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.398" end="00:41:24.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was trapped on a legion for years.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.118" end="00:41:25.678" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t learned how to defend</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.118" end="00:41:26.798" style="s2">myself, I would have died in that</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.678" end="00:41:27.838" style="s2">hellhole.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.798" end="00:41:29.598" style="s2">If you don&#39;t like me this way, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.838" end="00:41:30.638" style="s2">Wilson, I&#39;ll leave.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.598" end="00:41:31.678" style="s2">Thank you for taking me in when I had</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.638" end="00:41:33.038" style="s2">nowhere else to go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.678" end="00:41:34.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.038" end="00:41:35.798" style="s2">Victoria and Chloe come from powerful</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.318" end="00:41:38.438" style="s2">families. If they retaliate, you could</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.798" end="00:41:38.438" style="s2">be in danger.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.758" end="00:41:42.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then,</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.758" end="00:41:42.998" style="s2">will you protect me, Mr. Wilson?</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.438" end="00:41:47.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.638" end="00:41:47.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.238" end="00:41:49.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what role would you play, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.318" end="00:41:50.558" style="s2">Wilson?</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.358" end="00:41:51.298" style="s2">A friend?</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.558" end="00:41:53.318" style="s2">Or a lover?</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.298" end="00:41:53.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.238" end="00:41:58.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still a student at Saint Cross</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.318" end="00:41:59.638" style="s2">Academy.</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.598" end="00:42:02.118" style="s2">So, naturally, I&#39;m helping you as your</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.638" end="00:42:02.118" style="s2">guardian.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.318" end="00:42:05.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My guardian?</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.478" end="00:42:06.318" style="s2">I like that. Well, then, my dear</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.118" end="00:42:09.238" style="s2">guardian, if there&#39;s nothing else, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:09.238" style="s2">going upstairs to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.518" end="00:42:14.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was supposed to be testing her. How</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.238" end="00:42:15.478" style="s2">the hell did I end up as her guardian?</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.598" end="00:42:16.758" style="s2">Hayden,</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.478" end="00:42:17.798" style="s2">keep watching Evelyn tomorrow. If she</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.758" end="00:42:18.798" style="s2">does anything unusual, report it</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.798" end="00:42:19.958" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.798" end="00:42:21.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.958" end="00:42:24.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And tap your best intel sources. Find</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.598" end="00:42:24.678" style="s2">out if Nova&#39;s on the West Coast.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.638" end="00:42:32.638" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.318" end="00:42:38.718" style="s2">Oh my god, it&#39;s Alexander, Class A&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.198" end="00:42:40.398" style="s2">resident genius.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.718" end="00:42:42.718" style="s2">Do you think he came all this way for</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.398" end="00:42:42.718" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.158" end="00:42:47.038" style="s2">Duh. A genius like him would never spare</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.358" end="00:42:48.598" style="s2">Class F a glance.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.038" end="00:42:51.038" style="s2">If he&#39;s not here for me,</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.598" end="00:42:51.038" style="s2">then who?</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.160" end="00:42:58.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That broken girl from Elysian&#39;s black</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.400" end="00:43:00.360" style="s2">market?</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.840" end="00:43:03.840" style="s2">If Alexander becomes your boyfriend,</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.360" end="00:43:03.840" style="s2">every girl in school will be jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.720" end="00:43:11.680" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.000" end="00:43:13.400" style="s2">since you came all this way for me, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.680" end="00:43:15.760" style="s2">say yes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.400" end="00:43:18.360" style="s2">You can be my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.760" end="00:43:18.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re in my way.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.000" end="00:43:23.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.035" end="00:43:23.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.640" end="00:43:30.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.320" end="00:43:30.040" style="s2">is it really you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.160" end="00:43:36.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.880" end="00:43:41.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.840" end="00:43:44.280" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.600" end="00:43:45.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander?</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.280" end="00:43:48.560" style="s2">The little genius inventor who was</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.800" end="00:43:51.120" style="s2">always crying?</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.560" end="00:43:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.600" end="00:43:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.320" end="00:44:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.600" end="00:44:01.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. What are you doing? Put that down</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.320" end="00:44:05.720" style="s2">or I&#39;m getting the dean.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.720" end="00:44:05.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh, some busybody. Come on, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.840" end="00:44:08.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you fight back when they</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.000" end="00:44:12.280" style="s2">picked on you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.040" end="00:44:14.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I fail everything. Nobody likes me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.280" end="00:44:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who says nobody likes you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.280" end="00:44:17.040" style="s2">I like you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.720" end="00:44:22.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.640" end="00:44:24.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. You&#39;re Alexander, right? You</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.360" end="00:44:26.240" style="s2">won the creativity award at last month&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.080" end="00:44:28.080" style="s2">youth invention competition. Your design</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.240" end="00:44:29.400" style="s2">was amazing. Anyone who can invent</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.080" end="00:44:30.465" style="s2">something that good is definitely a</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.400" end="00:44:30.640" style="s2">genius.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.465" end="00:44:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.640" end="00:44:34.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And your grades are only bad because</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.000" end="00:44:35.760" style="s2">school bores you, so you don&#39;t try. If</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.120" end="00:44:37.670" style="s2">you actually focus, you can get straight</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.760" end="00:44:37.800" style="s2">A&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.670" end="00:44:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.800" end="00:44:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think I can?</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.520" end="00:44:44.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you can. Get an A on your next</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.520" end="00:44:45.560" style="s2">final for me, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.120" end="00:44:48.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.560" end="00:44:48.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it&#39;s settled.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.800" end="00:44:51.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.200" end="00:44:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.480" end="00:44:54.641" style="s2">that insecure little boy who used to</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.880" end="00:44:56.241" style="s2">hide in corners and let everyone push</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.641" end="00:44:58.881" style="s2">him around?</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.241" end="00:44:58.881" style="s2">He grew up.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.521" end="00:45:04.481" style="s2">And I kept my promise.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.681" end="00:45:06.481" style="s2">I took first place</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.481" end="00:45:08.841" style="s2">in every school-wide GPA ranking this</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.481" end="00:45:08.841" style="s2">month.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.961" end="00:45:12.041" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I always knew you&#39;d be incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.731" end="00:45:13.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.041" end="00:45:15.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were never the loser they said you</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.201" end="00:45:15.521" style="s2">were.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.971" end="00:45:18.841" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.281" end="00:45:19.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.841" end="00:45:22.161" style="s2">when I heard you disappeared, I never</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.961" end="00:45:23.801" style="s2">stopped looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.161" end="00:45:25.721" style="s2">All these years,</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.801" end="00:45:26.721" style="s2">seeing you home safe, I I can&#39;t tell you</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.721" end="00:45:29.561" style="s2">how happy I am.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.721" end="00:45:30.681" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I&#39;m fine, see?</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.561" end="00:45:31.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I seeing this right?</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.681" end="00:45:33.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you still such a crybaby?</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.921" end="00:45:34.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She just ruffled Alexander&#39;s hair?</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.201" end="00:45:35.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she insane? Alexander&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.401" end="00:45:36.801" style="s2">untouchable golden boy of this school.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.561" end="00:45:39.401" style="s2">He hates being touched. She&#39;s digging</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.801" end="00:45:39.401" style="s2">her own grave.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.561" end="00:45:42.401" style="s2">She&#39;s nothing but that broken girl from</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.681" end="00:45:43.281" style="s2">Elysium&#39;s black market.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.401" end="00:45:44.841" style="s2">Why is Alexander treating her so</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.281" end="00:45:47.081" style="s2">special? She must have tricked him with</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.841" end="00:45:48.441" style="s2">her looks.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.081" end="00:45:49.401" style="s2">Exactly. Someone as brilliant as</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.441" end="00:45:50.601" style="s2">Alexander belongs with a perfect,</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.401" end="00:45:51.801" style="s2">respectful girl like you. Someone like</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.601" end="00:45:53.001" style="s2">her could never be good enough for</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.801" end="00:45:54.241" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.001" end="00:45:55.961" style="s2">Evelyn&#39;s a failing student who doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.241" end="00:45:57.801" style="s2">know a thing. She only got into class F</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.961" end="00:45:59.001" style="s2">by pulling some shady [ __ ] You&#39;re class</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.801" end="00:45:59.401" style="s2">A&#39;s top student. Why hang around with</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.001" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">trash?</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.401" end="00:46:02.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.921" end="00:46:04.241" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I wrong? She turned in yesterday&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.561" end="00:46:05.241" style="s2">exam after 15 minutes. She obviously</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.241" end="00:46:08.561" style="s2">didn&#39;t know anything and handed in a</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.241" end="00:46:08.561" style="s2">blank paper. Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.401" end="00:46:13.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, you earned the only perfect</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.081" end="00:46:14.921" style="s2">score in the entire school on</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.281" end="00:46:17.001" style="s2">yesterday&#39;s exam. I&#39;ve entered you in</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.921" end="00:46:18.081" style="s2">this year&#39;s US Math Olympiad.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.001" end="00:46:19.401" style="s2">Come to my office later to fill out the</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.081" end="00:46:20.001" style="s2">paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.401" end="00:46:21.641" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.001" end="00:46:24.641" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A perfect score?</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.641" end="00:46:24.641" style="s2">THAT&#39;S IMPOSSIBLE.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.081" end="00:46:31.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn was helping Professor Van Dyke</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.281" end="00:46:32.361" style="s2">with chip research when she was 12.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.201" end="00:46:35.321" style="s2">Why shouldn&#39;t she represent Saint Cross</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.361" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">Academy in the US Math Olympiad?</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.321" end="00:46:38.881" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.921" end="00:46:39.961" style="s2">She worked with Professor Van Dyke?</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.881" end="00:46:43.001" style="s2">That&#39;s incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.961" end="00:46:45.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Evelyn&#39;s the real genius here?</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.001" end="00:46:47.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop this genius chick.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.481" end="00:46:49.481" style="s2">Good grades mean nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.801" end="00:46:50.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was stuck on Elysium&#39;s black market</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.481" end="00:46:52.441" style="s2">for 7 years.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.801" end="00:46:55.681" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God knows how many BASTARD KIDS SHE&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.441" end="00:46:55.681" style="s2">PROBABLY POPPED OUT THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.881" end="00:46:59.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; VICTORIA,</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.081" end="00:47:01.243" style="s2">say one more word about Evelyn and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.642" end="00:47:03.523" style="s2">rip your mouth apart.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.243" end="00:47:04.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, let go. She&#39;s not worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.523" end="00:47:07.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rotten people see everything is rotten.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.763" end="00:47:07.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay out of this, Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.043" end="00:47:12.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought Victoria was some beautiful,</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.523" end="00:47:14.483" style="s2">kind Iris.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.882" end="00:47:15.203" style="s2">I had no idea she was this vicious. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.483" end="00:47:16.523" style="s2">disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.203" end="00:47:18.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let her hold her self out to fool</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.523" end="00:47:19.483" style="s2">you. Lena told us all of it herself. Why</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.323" end="00:47:21.602" style="s2">would her own sister slander her?</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.483" end="00:47:22.963" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Lena&#39;s your own sister. She</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.602" end="00:47:24.763" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t lie, would she?</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.963" end="00:47:26.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Lena said it, maybe it&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.763" end="00:47:28.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena&#39;s the pride of this school. She</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.483" end="00:47:30.083" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t lie, would she?</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.243" end="00:47:32.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Lena says I had all those children,</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.083" end="00:47:33.523" style="s2">then she knew I wasn&#39;t dead.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.323" end="00:47:34.922" style="s2">So, why didn&#39;t she send anyone to save</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.523" end="00:47:36.162" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.922" end="00:47:36.922" style="s2">Why did she have my identity erased</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.162" end="00:47:38.523" style="s2">instead?</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.922" end="00:47:40.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop making things up. If you don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.523" end="00:47:42.323" style="s2">legal ID, how are you even enrolled</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.043" end="00:47:42.323" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.323" end="00:47:47.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn&#39;s identity records really were</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.642" end="00:47:50.122" style="s2">erased. These are the new papers she</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.362" end="00:47:50.122" style="s2">submitted yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.203" end="00:47:57.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.963" end="00:47:59.483" style="s2">Her sister was alive and Lena still had</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.483" end="00:48:00.843" style="s2">her identity erased?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.483" end="00:48:03.723" style="s2">And after everything her sister went</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.843" end="00:48:06.003" style="s2">through, Lena didn&#39;t stand up for her?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.723" end="00:48:07.483" style="s2">She spread rumors instead.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.003" end="00:48:09.362" style="s2">So much for the West Coast&#39;s top</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.483" end="00:48:12.122" style="s2">socialite.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.362" end="00:48:12.122" style="s2">She&#39;s rotten.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.003" end="00:48:16.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Decent people don&#39;t hang around with</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.162" end="00:48:17.602" style="s2">trash like them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.563" end="00:48:19.203" style="s2">Evelyn</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.602" end="00:48:21.043" style="s2">it&#39;s almost lunch time.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.203" end="00:48:23.642" style="s2">Let me take you to lunch. Ignore this</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.043" end="00:48:23.642" style="s2">garbage.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.402" end="00:48:27.882" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.843" end="00:48:37.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, you [ __ ] How dare you sink</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.442" end="00:48:40.283" style="s2">your claws into Alexander? You&#39;ve got a</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.483" end="00:48:40.283" style="s2">death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.602" end="00:48:47.523" style="s2">Is everything ready?</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.122" end="00:48:50.162" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.523" end="00:48:50.162" style="s2">Do it now.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.963" end="00:49:02.564" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every vulnerability is finally patched.</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.364" end="00:49:05.004" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.564" end="00:49:06.684" style="s2">even if Nova comes after me again,</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.004" end="00:49:09.884" style="s2">she&#39;ll have a hard time finding a single</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.684" end="00:49:09.884" style="s2">weakness in my system.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.644" end="00:49:15.684" style="s2">How are things going with Evelyn at St.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.964" end="00:49:17.884" style="s2">Cross Academy?</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.684" end="00:49:19.004" style="s2">Boss, Alexander from class A went to see</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.884" end="00:49:21.524" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.004" end="00:49:22.924" style="s2">They looked very close.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.524" end="00:49:25.444" style="s2">He even asked her to lunch in front of</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.924" end="00:49:25.444" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.804" end="00:49:31.364" style="s2">Lunch?</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.364" end="00:49:34.804" style="s2">Get the car.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.364" end="00:49:34.804" style="s2">We&#39;re going to St. Cross Academy.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.004" end="00:49:51.884" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is everything in place?</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.204" end="00:49:57.764" style="s2">Relax. I had them brought in through the</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.044" end="00:49:57.764" style="s2">back entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.844" end="00:50:03.364" style="s2">By the end of today, she&#39;ll be ruined in</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.084" end="00:50:04.324" style="s2">front of the entire school.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.364" end="00:50:06.804" style="s2">Look,</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.324" end="00:50:06.804" style="s2">they&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.044" end="00:50:13.204" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HONEY, I FINALLY FOUND YOU. WHY DID YOU</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.804" end="00:50:16.804" style="s2">RUN AWAY?</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.204" end="00:50:16.804" style="s2">YOU JUST ABANDONED ME AND OUR KID?</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.564" end="00:50:20.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OH MY GOD. Where did this homeless guy</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.524" end="00:50:23.284" style="s2">come from?</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.604" end="00:50:25.884" style="s2">How did he get into St. Cross Academy?</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.284" end="00:50:29.404" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is wrong with school security?</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.884" end="00:50:29.404" style="s2">Do they just let anyone in?</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.804" end="00:50:35.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, who exactly are you looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.644" end="00:50:35.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s your wife? Tell us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.964" end="00:50:38.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That woman right there.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.044" end="00:50:43.804" style="s2">Four years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.724" end="00:50:45.164" style="s2">I drained every last cent of my savings</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.804" end="00:50:46.804" style="s2">to marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.164" end="00:50:48.644" style="s2">Turns out she thought our family was too</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.804" end="00:50:51.844" style="s2">poor, so she cold-heartedly cleaned us</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.644" end="00:50:51.844" style="s2">out and skipped town.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.990" end="00:50:55.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.324" end="00:50:57.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:50:58.884" style="s2">what was that?</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.575" end="00:51:01.444" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.884" end="00:51:03.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. Muscle memory kicked in.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.444" end="00:51:05.405" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t pull it back in time.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.645" end="00:51:07.445" style="s2">This is bad.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.405" end="00:51:10.045" style="s2">If that old hawk Sebastian saw me, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.445" end="00:51:10.045" style="s2">screwed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.045" end="00:51:18.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.085" end="00:51:21.685" style="s2">did you see that?</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.325" end="00:51:21.685" style="s2">Evelyn&#39;s moves were flawless.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.925" end="00:51:25.405" style="s2">Even a highly trained special ops</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.525" end="00:51:26.805" style="s2">soldier would struggle to move like</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.405" end="00:51:29.765" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.805" end="00:51:29.765" style="s2">Just as I thought.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.965" end="00:51:33.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s the woman from Elysium.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.365" end="00:51:41.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little [ __ ] YOU HIT ME? I&#39;M GOING</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.005" end="00:51:41.965" style="s2">TO KILL YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.765" end="00:51:46.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DON&#39;T KNOW YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.285" end="00:51:48.165" style="s2">WHY&#39;D YOU CLAIM I WAS YOUR WIFE?</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.605" end="00:51:49.805" style="s2">Tell the truth, or we&#39;ll call the</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.165" end="00:51:51.405" style="s2">police.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.805" end="00:51:53.845" style="s2">You do know the Wilson family funds this</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.405" end="00:51:53.845" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.045" end="00:51:57.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cause trouble here and cross the Wilson</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.685" end="00:52:00.725" style="s2">family, and you&#39;ll spend the rest of</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.245" end="00:52:00.725" style="s2">your life in a black site prison.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.965" end="00:52:06.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call the cops.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.725" end="00:52:07.965" style="s2">Don&#39;t involve the Wilson family. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.405" end="00:52:10.165" style="s2">paid me 10 grand to bring a kid here and</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.965" end="00:52:12.965" style="s2">frame you. It was her! SHE PAID ME TO</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.165" end="00:52:15.125" style="s2">RUIN YOUR REPUTATION!</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.965" end="00:52:17.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP MAKING GARBAGE UP. WHEN did I ever</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.125" end="00:52:18.085" style="s2">pay you to frame Evelyn? Don&#39;t you dare</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.085" end="00:52:19.765" style="s2">pin this on me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.085" end="00:52:21.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.765" end="00:52:23.765" style="s2">I knew some spoiled rich girl like you</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.605" end="00:52:26.645" style="s2">might refuse to pay up, so I recorded</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.765" end="00:52:26.645" style="s2">the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.966" end="00:52:29.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.245" end="00:52:34.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That flash drive has security footage of</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.285" end="00:52:36.285" style="s2">you paying me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.405" end="00:52:39.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t believe him. He&#39;s a lunatic from</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.285" end="00:52:39.965" style="s2">the slums. He&#39;s lying.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.205" end="00:52:46.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s one easy way to find out. Step</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.565" end="00:52:46.605" style="s2">two, get you to give yourself away.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.205" end="00:52:51.205" style="s2">Play it on the big screen.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.365" end="00:52:53.885" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.165" end="00:52:58.685" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it TO ME! GIVE IT!</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.371" end="00:53:03.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.605" end="00:53:04.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t you just swearing Jack was</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.765" end="00:53:06.247" style="s2">lying?</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.725" end="00:53:08.567" style="s2">If it&#39;s all fake, what are you so afraid</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.247" end="00:53:08.567" style="s2">of?</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.207" end="00:53:18.807" style="s2">I have one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.927" end="00:53:20.567" style="s2">Destroy her reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.807" end="00:53:23.647" style="s2">I want that [ __ ] Evelyn driven out of</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.567" end="00:53:23.647" style="s2">Saint Cross Academy.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.727" end="00:53:26.687" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.967" end="00:53:28.207" style="s2">As long as the money&#39;s good,</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.687" end="00:53:28.881" style="s2">I&#39;ll get it done.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.207" end="00:53:29.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.881" end="00:53:30.767" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.167" end="00:53:33.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When it&#39;s done,</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.767" end="00:53:35.807" style="s2">you&#39;ll get another 10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.167" end="00:53:37.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, it really was Victoria. She</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.807" end="00:53:41.087" style="s2">paid some thug to spread lies about a</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.447" end="00:53:41.087" style="s2">classmate? That&#39;s vile.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.407" end="00:53:46.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She acts like some pure little angel,</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.967" end="00:53:48.407" style="s2">but behind closed doors she&#39;s vicious</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.727" end="00:53:51.207" style="s2">and calculating.</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.407" end="00:53:51.207" style="s2">Disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.927" end="00:53:55.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not me. It&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.847" end="00:54:02.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t expect the Windsor Andrews to</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.247" end="00:54:02.487" style="s2">be coming after Evelyn, too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.927" end="00:54:06.607" style="s2">Cut every business tie between the</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.607" end="00:54:08.727" style="s2">Wilsons and the Windsors.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.607" end="00:54:11.847" style="s2">I want the Windsor family bankrupt, and</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.727" end="00:54:11.847" style="s2">I want it done yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.007" end="00:54:16.287" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.127" end="00:54:17.327" style="s2">But, boss, aren&#39;t we going after Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.287" end="00:54:18.407" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.327" end="00:54:20.967" style="s2">Why are we suddenly targeting the</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.407" end="00:54:20.967" style="s2">Windsors?</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.007" end="00:54:26.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been talking too much lately.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.367" end="00:54:28.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, boss. I&#39;ll take care of it right</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.087" end="00:54:28.367" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.047" end="00:54:33.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria,</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.327" end="00:54:34.607" style="s2">stay calm.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.087" end="00:54:35.807" style="s2">If it comes to it, we&#39;ll call Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.607" end="00:54:38.487" style="s2">Windsor and have him handle this</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.807" end="00:54:38.487" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.807" end="00:54:43.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.407" end="00:54:45.087" style="s2">So, what if you have video proof?</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.927" end="00:54:48.287" style="s2">The Windsors are one of the most</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.087" end="00:54:49.447" style="s2">powerful families on the West Coast.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.287" end="00:54:52.167" style="s2">You know what happens to people who</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.447" end="00:54:52.167" style="s2">cross us.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.727" end="00:54:56.807" style="s2">Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.927" end="00:54:56.807" style="s2">and what happens?</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.287" end="00:55:05.567" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cross the Windsor family,</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.287" end="00:55:07.127" style="s2">and I&#39;ll make her beg for death.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.567" end="00:55:08.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.127" end="00:55:11.008" style="s2">The head of the Windsor family came</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.328" end="00:55:11.008" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.648" end="00:55:16.088" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Evelyn&#39;s in serious trouble now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.448" end="00:55:20.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re finally here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.648" end="00:55:29.608" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re the one who framed my</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.328" end="00:55:31.048" style="s2">daughter and destroyed her reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.608" end="00:55:33.328" style="s2">That thug on the floor is your</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.048" end="00:55:35.128" style="s2">accomplice, isn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.328" end="00:55:36.448" style="s2">You staged this whole thing just to</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.128" end="00:55:37.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; smear her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.448" end="00:55:39.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.918" end="00:55:40.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.208" end="00:55:42.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frame her?</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.768" end="00:55:44.728" style="s2">Then what do you call that video of the</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.008" end="00:55:46.848" style="s2">two of them making the deal?</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.728" end="00:55:48.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With today&#39;s technology and AI face swap</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.848" end="00:55:50.048" style="s2">is child&#39;s play.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.208" end="00:55:52.648" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s right. With AI now, you really</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.048" end="00:55:54.168" style="s2">can&#39;t tell.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.648" end="00:55:54.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, is it real or fake? I&#39;m completely</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.168" end="00:55:56.488" style="s2">lost.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.928" end="00:55:59.488" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s an AI fake.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.488" end="00:55:59.488" style="s2">You made it to frame me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.328" end="00:56:05.368" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.688" end="00:56:06.688" style="s2">You hired someone to put on an act and</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.368" end="00:56:08.248" style="s2">smear you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.688" end="00:56:11.008" style="s2">Also, you could pin it on me and leave</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.248" end="00:56:13.528" style="s2">me unable to defend myself.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.008" end="00:56:15.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria&#39;s been a top student for years.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.528" end="00:56:19.328" style="s2">She even received City Hall&#39;s Star of</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.128" end="00:56:19.328" style="s2">Courage. She&#39;d never frame anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.888" end="00:56:24.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One woman spent 7 years locked in the</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.088" end="00:56:27.328" style="s2">black market and came back tainted.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.848" end="00:56:28.848" style="s2">The other is an Iris with a brilliant</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.328" end="00:56:30.408" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.848" end="00:56:33.488" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to be a genius to know</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.408" end="00:56:33.488" style="s2">who&#39;s framing who.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.968" end="00:56:36.488" style="s2">Victoria,</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.088" end="00:56:37.288" style="s2">are you sure you deserve the title Star</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.488" end="00:56:38.688" style="s2">of Courage?</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.288" end="00:56:40.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I escaped, then gave the police the</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.688" end="00:56:42.328" style="s2">traffickers&#39; location. City Hall had</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.568" end="00:56:44.368" style="s2">every reason to honor me. What, are you</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.328" end="00:56:45.808" style="s2">questioning the mayor?</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.368" end="00:56:47.048" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.808" end="00:56:49.768" style="s2">But even a mayor can be fooled by a</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.048" end="00:56:49.768" style="s2">petty liar.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.048" end="00:56:54.808" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve held this honor for 7 years.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.328" end="00:56:57.088" style="s2">You really think one little accusation</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.808" end="00:56:59.848" style="s2">from you can change that?</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.088" end="00:56:59.848" style="s2">Check your phones.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.368" end="00:57:03.528" style="s2">City Hall bulletin.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.248" end="00:57:04.928" style="s2">After review, we&#39;ve determined that</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.528" end="00:57:07.288" style="s2">during the major Elysium trafficking</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.928" end="00:57:08.888" style="s2">case 7 years ago, Victoria knowingly</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.288" end="00:57:10.769" style="s2">gave false information and deliberately</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.888" end="00:57:12.809" style="s2">misdirected investigators, delaying the</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.769" end="00:57:14.249" style="s2">case. Her Star of Courage is hereby</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.809" end="00:57:16.889" style="s2">revoked and she will face criminal</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.249" end="00:57:16.889" style="s2">charges.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.929" end="00:57:21.289" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.329" end="00:57:24.369" style="s2">This can&#39;t be real.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.289" end="00:57:25.769" style="s2">They actually revoked it?</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.369" end="00:57:27.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to target the Winzen family</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.769" end="00:57:28.529" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.169" end="00:57:31.329" style="s2">If I&#39;m right, they&#39;re about to have much</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.529" end="00:57:31.329" style="s2">bigger problems.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.489" end="00:57:35.129" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.969" end="00:57:42.129" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.609" end="00:57:43.529" style="s2">Why would City Hall suddenly announce</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.129" end="00:57:44.449" style="s2">they&#39;re stripping Victoria of the Star</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.529" end="00:57:46.609" style="s2">of Courage?</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.449" end="00:57:47.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would they revoke it now? You [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.609" end="00:57:49.409" style="s2">you did this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.769" end="00:57:51.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Why would City Hall suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.409" end="00:57:53.449" style="s2">reverse a decision from 7 years ago? If</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.569" end="00:57:56.329" style="s2">you don&#39;t believe it,</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.449" end="00:57:56.329" style="s2">turn on the TV.</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.289" end="00:58:01.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name&#39;s Anna. I was one of the girls</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.929" end="00:58:03.409" style="s2">trafficked to Elysian. I&#39;m going on the</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.809" end="00:58:04.609" style="s2">record to tell the truth about Victoria,</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.409" end="00:58:06.889" style="s2">the woman who received the Star of</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.609" end="00:58:08.849" style="s2">Courage 7 years ago. She didn&#39;t escape</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.889" end="00:58:11.009" style="s2">because she was clever. She bought her</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.849" end="00:58:13.009" style="s2">freedom by selling out every one of us.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.009" end="00:58:14.489" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name&#39;s Sophia. Because she betrayed</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.009" end="00:58:15.369" style="s2">us, we spent 7 straight years being</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.489" end="00:58:16.729" style="s2">tortured in Elysian.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.369" end="00:58:19.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia. All of us girls came up with an</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.729" end="00:58:21.769" style="s2">escape plan and Victoria sold us out.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.969" end="00:58:23.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After reopening the Elysian case files,</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.769" end="00:58:25.129" style="s2">we found that the information Victoria</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.169" end="00:58:26.329" style="s2">gave us directly contradicted the facts.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.129" end="00:58:27.809" style="s2">She&#39;s suspected of perjury.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.329" end="00:58:29.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who the hell are you? How could you</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.809" end="00:58:31.329" style="s2">possibly have found this evidence?</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.849" end="00:58:32.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who am I?</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.329" end="00:58:35.209" style="s2">Just the ghost who crawled out of</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.609" end="00:58:36.735" style="s2">Elysian&#39;s hell to collect a debt.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.209" end="00:58:37.390" style="s2">A life debt.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.735" end="00:58:39.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.390" end="00:58:39.410" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.649" end="00:58:47.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.009" end="00:58:50.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, you need to come with us to</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.529" end="00:58:50.649" style="s2">the station for questioning.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.849" end="00:58:54.169" style="s2">Chloe, someone has filed a formal</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.329" end="00:58:55.569" style="s2">complaint accusing you of defamation.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.169" end="00:58:58.289" style="s2">You&#39;re coming with us, too.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.569" end="00:58:59.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Let go of me. Victoria did IT, NOT</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.289" end="00:59:01.409" style="s2">ME.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.729" end="00:59:02.409" style="s2">DAD, HELP ME.</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.409" end="00:59:04.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.409" end="00:59:05.409" style="s2">I RUN THE WINZEN FAMILY. THERE HAS TO BE</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.329" end="00:59:06.889" style="s2">some misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.409" end="00:59:08.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Winzen, if you insist on obstructing</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.889" end="00:59:10.569" style="s2">police work, we&#39;ll have to take you in</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.049" end="00:59:10.569" style="s2">as well.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.009" end="00:59:14.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That won&#39;t be necessary.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.731" end="00:59:24.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The final step of my revenge. Ruin you</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.251" end="00:59:26.971" style="s2">in front of everyone isn&#39;t enough. You</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.211" end="00:59:28.771" style="s2">must face justice, Victoria. Maybe then</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.971" end="00:59:30.171" style="s2">the girl who nearly died on Elysium can</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.771" end="00:59:33.091" style="s2">finally rest.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.171" end="00:59:33.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did all this?</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.651" end="00:59:36.411" style="s2">Drop the charges and let Victoria go and</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.131" end="00:59:38.611" style="s2">I may be merciful enough to spare your</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.411" end="00:59:40.051" style="s2">life. Refuse and I&#39;ll show you exactly</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.611" end="00:59:41.811" style="s2">what the Windsor family can do.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.051" end="00:59:42.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Windsor, are you threatening me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.811" end="00:59:43.531" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you worried about crossing my</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.931" end="00:59:45.411" style="s2">guardian?</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.531" end="00:59:47.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Bring him here. I don&#39;t care who</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.411" end="00:59:51.091" style="s2">he is. The Windsor family will teach him</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.171" end="00:59:51.091" style="s2">exactly what happens when you cross me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.811" end="01:00:04.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s he doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.371" end="01:00:07.131" style="s2">Did he catch me taking that guy out just</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.851" end="01:00:07.131" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.971" end="01:00:13.771" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson?</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.371" end="01:00:13.771" style="s2">What What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.411" end="01:00:19.971" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, yesterday</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.971" end="01:00:21.611" style="s2">you said you&#39;d be my guardian. Does that</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.971" end="01:00:23.291" style="s2">still stand?</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.611" end="01:00:25.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.291" end="01:00:26.291" style="s2">I&#39;m Evelyn&#39;s guardian.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.171" end="01:00:27.291" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you just saying you&#39;d make her</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.291" end="01:00:29.291" style="s2">guardian pay?</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.291" end="01:00:30.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re her guardian?</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.291" end="01:00:32.531" style="s2">This This has to be a misunderstanding,</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.811" end="01:00:33.891" style="s2">Mr. Wilson. She&#39;s deceiving you. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.531" end="01:00:37.011" style="s2">nothing but trash that crawled out of</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.891" end="01:00:37.011" style="s2">the Elysium slums.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.451" end="01:00:40.131" style="s2">What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.611" end="01:00:42.171" style="s2">An unknown party launched a devastating</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.131" end="01:00:43.971" style="s2">financial attack on the company?</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.171" end="01:00:45.811" style="s2">Our capital chain is completely severed.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.971" end="01:00:46.811" style="s2">We&#39;re wiped out?</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.811" end="01:00:48.611" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.811" end="01:00:50.131" style="s2">The Windsors are done for.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.611" end="01:00:53.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, didn&#39;t you just call off the hit</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.131" end="01:00:53.531" style="s2">on the Windsor family&#39;s businesses?</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.771" end="01:00:59.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t the Wilson family.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.691" end="01:01:01.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, I was wrong. Please, have</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.331" end="01:01:02.571" style="s2">mercy. Spare the Windsor family.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.211" end="01:01:05.691" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get him out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.571" end="01:01:08.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. WILSON, SPARE ME. I KNOW I WAS</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.691" end="01:01:08.411" style="s2">WRONG.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.651" end="01:01:16.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One hit, perfectly placed, and a grown</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.051" end="01:01:17.532" style="s2">man drops. Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.092" end="01:01:20.292" style="s2">don&#39;t you think you owe your guardian an</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.532" end="01:01:20.292" style="s2">explanation?</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.652" end="01:01:26.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what?</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.292" end="01:01:27.972" style="s2">Mr. Wilson, do you really suspect me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.132" end="01:01:29.372" style="s2">If they&#39;d taken me just now,</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.972" end="01:01:31.812" style="s2">they would have sold me into Elysium&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.372" end="01:01:34.452" style="s2">black market all over again.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.812" end="01:01:36.012" style="s2">I never want to relive that living hell.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.452" end="01:01:38.452" style="s2">Am I not even allowed to fight back when</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.012" end="01:01:40.012" style="s2">I&#39;m in danger?</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.452" end="01:01:42.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know that&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.012" end="01:01:44.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I was trafficked, so you think</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.212" end="01:01:47.532" style="s2">I&#39;m damaged. Deep down you look down on</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.412" end="01:01:50.052" style="s2">me. Fine. I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.532" end="01:01:50.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.252" end="01:01:53.412" style="s2">Where were you when she needed you? You</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.812" end="01:01:55.532" style="s2">don&#39;t deserve to be her guardian. Let</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.412" end="01:01:57.092" style="s2">go. I&#39;m taking her to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.532" end="01:01:59.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.092" end="01:02:02.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, I&#39;m telling you she&#39;s faking it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.012" end="01:02:02.252" style="s2">Want me to pinch her and prove it?</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.572" end="01:02:12.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice save.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.892" end="01:02:12.772" style="s2">Now get me out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.972" end="01:02:15.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.892" end="01:02:19.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, weren&#39;t you sure she was the woman</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.452" end="01:02:20.492" style="s2">from Elysium? If you let them leave, she</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.852" end="01:02:21.412" style="s2">won&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.492" end="01:02:22.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zip it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.412" end="01:02:24.572" style="s2">Keep running your mouth and I&#39;ll send</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.572" end="01:02:27.812" style="s2">you off to Siberia to dig coal. Marry</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.572" end="01:02:30.052" style="s2">you to one of those local she-bears.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.812" end="01:02:32.012" style="s2">The way she broke down just now,</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.052" end="01:02:34.532" style="s2">that didn&#39;t look like a lie.</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.012" end="01:02:36.492" style="s2">Was I wrong to suspect her?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.532" end="01:02:38.772" style="s2">Kane, pull every file on the girls</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.492" end="01:02:40.692" style="s2">trafficked to Elysium 7 years ago. Find</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.772" end="01:02:42.812" style="s2">out exactly what happened to them, and</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.692" end="01:02:45.252" style="s2">confirm whether Evelyn was one of them.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.812" end="01:02:45.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.812" end="01:02:53.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for playing along back there. You</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.372" end="01:02:56.652" style="s2">got me out of a tight spot.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.732" end="01:02:56.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just glad you&#39;re okay.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.412" end="01:02:59.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got to go. We&#39;ll catch up another</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.972" end="01:03:03.012" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.652" end="01:03:03.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;ll head back.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.292" end="01:03:07.972" style="s2">Evelyn, whatever happens, I&#39;ll always</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.852" end="01:03:10.732" style="s2">have your back. You can count on me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.972" end="01:03:10.732" style="s2">Stay strong.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.652" end="01:03:19.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur,</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.692" end="01:03:21.493" style="s2">I think I&#39;ve nearly confirmed who Dark</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.293" end="01:03:22.853" style="s2">Sun&#39;s overlord really is.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.493" end="01:03:24.893" style="s2">Bring Black Stellar&#39;s best people to the</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.853" end="01:03:25.973" style="s2">West Coast.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.893" end="01:03:30.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.973" end="01:03:32.093" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not 100%, but I&#39;m about 80% sure.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.573" end="01:03:34.253" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Overlord has never shown his face in the</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.093" end="01:03:36.533" style="s2">real world. There isn&#39;t even a photo or</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.253" end="01:03:37.693" style="s2">biometric trace of him on the dark web.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.533" end="01:03:39.093" style="s2">How could he suddenly surface on the</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.693" end="01:03:40.333" style="s2">West Coast?</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.093" end="01:03:42.453" style="s2">Nova, this isn&#39;t something to take</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.333" end="01:03:43.253" style="s2">light.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.453" end="01:03:44.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just [clears throat] saw what looked</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.253" end="01:03:46.133" style="s2">like Dark Sun operatives obeying his</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.933" end="01:03:49.613" style="s2">every command.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.133" end="01:03:50.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spare me. I KNOW I WAS WRONG.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.613" end="01:03:52.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is he?</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.813" end="01:03:53.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian Wilson, head of the Wilson</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.733" end="01:03:56.053" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.973" end="01:03:58.413" style="s2">Leak word, Orion Syndicate hosts a</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.053" end="01:03:59.693" style="s2">business gala in 3 days opening partner</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.413" end="01:04:01.693" style="s2">bids.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.693" end="01:04:03.213" style="s2">They crave our contracts. If he dare</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.693" end="01:04:06.133" style="s2">show up, he&#39;ll learn the price of</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.213" end="01:04:07.773" style="s2">crossing Black Stellar. But first,</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.133" end="01:04:09.813" style="s2">I need one final test at tonight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.773" end="01:04:12.773" style="s2">engagement party.</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.813" end="01:04:12.773" style="s2">I have to be sure.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.613" end="01:04:19.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, the supercomputer&#39;s data</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.373" end="01:04:21.293" style="s2">comparison and facial reconstruction</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.053" end="01:04:23.013" style="s2">give us an 80% match.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.293" end="01:04:24.973" style="s2">Evelyn is the girl who planned an escape</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.013" end="01:04:26.413" style="s2">from Elysian&#39;s underground prison 7</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.973" end="01:04:28.973" style="s2">years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.413" end="01:04:30.533" style="s2">led all the girls in the attempt,</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.973" end="01:04:31.693" style="s2">and was ultimately beaten and left for</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.533" end="01:04:33.093" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.693" end="01:04:34.893" style="s2">She went through more on Elysian than</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.093" end="01:04:36.253" style="s2">anyone should ever have to.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.893" end="01:04:37.933" style="s2">Put the word out.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.253" end="01:04:40.093" style="s2">Make the Windsors pay.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.933" end="01:04:41.573" style="s2">Especially Victoria. I want her behind</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.093" end="01:04:42.733" style="s2">bars for the rest of her life.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.573" end="01:04:44.493" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.733" end="01:04:46.093" style="s2">One more thing. We confirmed Black</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.493" end="01:04:47.613" style="s2">Stellar&#39;s leader, Nova, is back on the</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.093" end="01:04:48.933" style="s2">West Coast. She was the one who</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.613" end="01:04:51.493" style="s2">organized those girls&#39; televised</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.933" end="01:04:52.813" style="s2">testimony behind the scenes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.493" end="01:04:53.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say what you&#39;re thinking.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.813" end="01:04:55.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.773" end="01:04:58.333" style="s2">every clue and odd coincidence is adds</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.773" end="01:04:59.853" style="s2">up. Evelyn is most likely Nova. Give the</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.333" end="01:05:01.533" style="s2">word and I&#39;ll take a team and grab her</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.853" end="01:05:04.853" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.533" end="01:05:04.853" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are a lot of coincidences,</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.973" end="01:05:09.093" style="s2">but they&#39;re still just our assumptions.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.613" end="01:05:10.853" style="s2">We don&#39;t have hard evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.093" end="01:05:12.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, Dark Sun strikes as soon as we</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.853" end="01:05:15.533" style="s2">identify a threat. Since when do we wait</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.733" end="01:05:15.533" style="s2">for hard evidence?</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.893" end="01:05:22.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn was once engaged to Kevin, and</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.933" end="01:05:23.495" style="s2">the old man is very fond of her now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.015" end="01:05:24.895" style="s2">If we move against her without absolute</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.495" end="01:05:25.935" style="s2">proof, it could cause trouble inside the</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.895" end="01:05:28.415" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.935" end="01:05:29.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. You think of everything, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.415" end="01:05:31.135" style="s2">So, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.735" end="01:05:33.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin and Lena&#39;s engagement party is</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.135" end="01:05:35.055" style="s2">tonight. Evelyn will be there.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.495" end="01:05:36.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll test her myself.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.055" end="01:05:38.175" style="s2">If she slips up and I can confirm who</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.535" end="01:05:40.815" style="s2">she really is,</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.175" end="01:05:40.815" style="s2">then we move.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.935" end="01:05:47.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Kevin.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.055" end="01:05:50.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Lena.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.975" end="01:05:52.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.135" end="01:05:53.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin, you don&#39;t think that woman from</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.055" end="01:05:55.055" style="s2">the slums will show up and try to steal</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.575" end="01:05:56.695" style="s2">you back, do you?</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.055" end="01:05:58.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Lena. You&#39;re the only one I</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.695" end="01:06:00.375" style="s2">want. If she tries anything, security</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.575" end="01:06:02.055" style="s2">will throw her out.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.375" end="01:06:02.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Kevin. I knew you&#39;d take care</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.055" end="01:06:04.255" style="s2">of me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.735" end="01:06:06.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Wilsons and the Blooms are joining</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.255" end="01:06:07.655" style="s2">forces through marriage. Looks like</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.055" end="01:06:08.775" style="s2">they&#39;re about to become a major force on</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.655" end="01:06:11.015" style="s2">the West Coast.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.775" end="01:06:12.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No kidding. Lena&#39;s beautiful, and I hear</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.015" end="01:06:13.935" style="s2">she&#39;s a brilliant scholar. She and Kevin</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.855" end="01:06:15.655" style="s2">are the perfect match.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.935" end="01:06:17.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Kevin was originally engaged to</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.655" end="01:06:17.735" style="s2">Evelyn, the Bloom family&#39;s older</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.135" end="01:06:19.575" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.735" end="01:06:21.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t heard? Evelyn was trafficked</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.575" end="01:06:23.455" style="s2">into Elysian&#39;s black market 7 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.735" end="01:06:25.415" style="s2">They only found her a few days back. 7</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.455" end="01:06:26.695" style="s2">years in a place like that? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.415" end="01:06:30.015" style="s2">probably been married and had a few</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.695" end="01:06:30.015" style="s2">bastard kids by now.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.961" end="01:06:32.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.935" end="01:06:40.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My god, she&#39;s gorgeous. She doesn&#39;t look</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.815" end="01:06:41.615" style="s2">like she&#39;s been through all that. She</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.255" end="01:06:42.815" style="s2">looks like royalty.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.615" end="01:06:45.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next to her, Lena doesn&#39;t stand a</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.815" end="01:06:45.335" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.026" end="01:06:48.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.215" end="01:06:55.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your sister&#39;s engagement party.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.255" end="01:06:56.855" style="s2">What are you doing here? Get out before</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.255" end="01:06:58.175" style="s2">you offend everyone just by showing your</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.855" end="01:06:59.781" style="s2">face.</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.175" end="01:06:59.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least you remember I&#39;m a Bloom.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.781" end="01:07:01.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.975" end="01:07:04.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My own sister is getting engaged. How</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.495" end="01:07:04.735" style="s2">could I possibly miss that?</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.575" end="01:07:09.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of sister are you? With the</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.415" end="01:07:10.895" style="s2">Blooms marrying into the Wilson family,</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.495" end="01:07:13.375" style="s2">we&#39;re destined to stand at the top of</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.895" end="01:07:14.815" style="s2">the West Coast. Keeping a stain like you</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.375" end="01:07:16.375" style="s2">around will only give High Society</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.815" end="01:07:18.175" style="s2">something to gossip about.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.375" end="01:07:19.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s right. I don&#39;t want people</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.175" end="01:07:21.775" style="s2">whispering about me every time I go out</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.855" end="01:07:23.856" style="s2">just because I have a sister like her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.775" end="01:07:26.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Evelyn, don&#39;t bother coming</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.856" end="01:07:26.896" style="s2">back to the Bloom house.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.456" end="01:07:33.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to cut ties? Then sign this</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.216" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">agreement severing all family ties.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.186" end="01:07:34.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.336" end="01:07:36.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had this ready?</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.656" end="01:07:37.496" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew this day would come the moment</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.056" end="01:07:39.296" style="s2">you married my stepmother when I was</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.496" end="01:07:41.296" style="s2">five.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.296" end="01:07:42.696" style="s2">Sign it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.296" end="01:07:44.136" style="s2">That way when disaster comes for the</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.696" end="01:07:46.616" style="s2">Blooms, it won&#39;t have anything to do</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.136" end="01:07:46.616" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.696" end="01:07:51.976" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. You want it? You got it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.526" end="01:07:53.296" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.976" end="01:07:54.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You signed it, so you&#39;re not a Bloom</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.296" end="01:07:57.776" style="s2">anymore. You&#39;re not welcome at my</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.816" end="01:07:57.776" style="s2">engagement party.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.296" end="01:08:01.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A stray from the slums thinks she</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.016" end="01:08:03.856" style="s2">belongs at an engagement party like</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.656" end="01:08:07.216" style="s2">this? She&#39;s nothing but bad luck.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.856" end="01:08:07.216" style="s2">Security, throw her out.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.416" end="01:08:20.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does anyone here have a problem with the</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.016" end="01:08:20.936" style="s2">engagement party my family is hosting?</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.296" end="01:08:26.696" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, my wife didn&#39;t mean to</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.536" end="01:08:29.136" style="s2">offend you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.696" end="01:08:30.256" style="s2">Evelyn grew up in Elysian Slums.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.136" end="01:08:32.816" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t know the rules of high</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.256" end="01:08:35.456" style="s2">society.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.816" end="01:08:38.136" style="s2">We were afraid she&#39;d upset your guests.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.456" end="01:08:40.416" style="s2">That&#39;s why we spoke so harshly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.136" end="01:08:42.496" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, Mr. Wilson.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.416" end="01:08:45.416" style="s2">Evelyn just signed an agreement severing</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.496" end="01:08:47.736" style="s2">ties with the Blooms.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.416" end="01:08:49.336" style="s2">She isn&#39;t one of us anymore. We only</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.736" end="01:08:51.376" style="s2">wanted her gone so she wouldn&#39;t ruin the</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.336" end="01:08:52.896" style="s2">evening for your distinguished guests.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.376" end="01:08:56.696" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you think being trafficked made her</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.896" end="01:08:56.696" style="s2">an embarrassment to the Bloom family?</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.216" end="01:09:02.256" style="s2">Their own daughter gets abducted, then</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.256" end="01:09:04.896" style="s2">finally comes home.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.256" end="01:09:07.816" style="s2">Any parent should be sick with guilt.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.896" end="01:09:09.416" style="s2">How could they call her a stain?</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.816" end="01:09:12.456" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Richard built his fortune on a</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.416" end="01:09:15.176" style="s2">huge trust left by Evelyn&#39;s late mother.</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.456" end="01:09:16.736" style="s2">Now that the rightful heir is back,</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.176" end="01:09:19.656" style="s2">of course they&#39;ll do anything to drive</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.736" end="01:09:23.256" style="s2">her out and keep all that money.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.656" end="01:09:23.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop spreading lies.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.816" end="01:09:28.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, that&#39;s not what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.137" end="01:09:31.742" style="s2">Evelyn is completely out of control.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.418" end="01:09:31.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn is my personal guest.</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.742" end="01:09:33.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.777" end="01:09:35.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when do you get to throw her out?</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.858" end="01:09:36.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson,</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.697" end="01:09:38.177" style="s2">you&#39;ve never shown any interest in</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.938" end="01:09:39.817" style="s2">women.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.177" end="01:09:40.097" style="s2">Why would you invite someone with a past</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.817" end="01:09:42.898" style="s2">like</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.097" end="01:09:45.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If not for Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.898" end="01:09:48.978" style="s2">do you think the Wilson family would</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.018" end="01:09:50.777" style="s2">give the Blooms a second glance?</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.978" end="01:09:52.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson,</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.777" end="01:09:54.538" style="s2">wh- what do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.858" end="01:09:56.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the Blooms can be this heartless to</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.538" end="01:09:59.298" style="s2">their own daughter,</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.578" end="01:10:00.258" style="s2">I can&#39;t trust them in business.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.298" end="01:10:02.657" style="s2">Kane,</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.258" end="01:10:04.258" style="s2">spread the word.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.657" end="01:10:05.858" style="s2">As of today,</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.258" end="01:10:07.378" style="s2">the Wilsons are done doing business with</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.858" end="01:10:09.898" style="s2">the Blooms.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.378" end="01:10:11.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.898" end="01:10:14.137" style="s2">You all heard him.</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.578" end="01:10:16.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think carefully about what happens to</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.137" end="01:10:19.137" style="s2">anyone who does business with an</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.858" end="01:10:22.137" style="s2">ungrateful family</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.137" end="01:10:22.137" style="s2">like the Blooms.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.858" end="01:10:29.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.898" end="01:10:29.738" style="s2">standing up for me in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.137" end="01:10:33.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Wilson family has made its position</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.978" end="01:10:35.498" style="s2">clear.</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.898" end="01:10:37.858" style="s2">Effective today,</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.498" end="01:10:39.097" style="s2">the Rockford Con Coalition is ending all</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.858" end="01:10:40.137" style="s2">business</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.097" end="01:10:42.258" style="s2">with the Blooms.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.137" end="01:10:43.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.258" end="01:10:45.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.978" end="01:10:47.617" style="s2">A family that can toss aside its own</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.698" end="01:10:49.938" style="s2">daughter has no morals and cares only</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.617" end="01:10:52.298" style="s2">for itself.</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.938" end="01:10:54.458" style="s2">The Davis Group is cutting all ties with</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.298" end="01:10:57.097" style="s2">them immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.458" end="01:10:59.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And on behalf of the DuPont family,</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.097" end="01:11:00.298" style="s2">I&#39;m terminating every supply contract we</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.338" end="01:11:01.258" style="s2">have with the Blooms.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.298" end="01:11:02.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.258" end="01:11:05.498" style="s2">Please. We&#39;ve been friends for years.</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.938" end="01:11:07.698" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.498" end="01:11:09.137" style="s2">If you all pull out, our cash flow will</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.698" end="01:11:12.778" style="s2">collapse.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.137" end="01:11:14.018" style="s2">The Blooms will be bankrupt overnight.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.778" end="01:11:15.617" style="s2">Lena,</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.018" end="01:11:17.298" style="s2">what are you standing there for? GO BEG</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.617" end="01:11:18.858" style="s2">KEVIN TO HELP US.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.298" end="01:11:20.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KEVIN?</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.858" end="01:11:21.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KEVIN, if you&#39;re so determined to join</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.338" end="01:11:23.177" style="s2">their family,</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.657" end="01:11:24.578" style="s2">I&#39;ll let you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.177" end="01:11:26.137" style="s2">Kane.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.578" end="01:11:27.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.137" end="01:11:29.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As of today,</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.458" end="01:11:31.899" style="s2">cancel every black card in Kevin&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.979" end="01:11:34.859" style="s2">Freeze his trust fund and all his</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.899" end="01:11:34.859" style="s2">private assets.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.859" end="01:11:39.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.099" end="01:11:41.419" style="s2">I&#39;ve lost everything.</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.939" end="01:11:42.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin, you&#39;re scaring me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.419" end="01:11:45.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OFF ME!</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.979" end="01:11:47.059" style="s2">THIS IS ALL YOUR FAULT!</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.099" end="01:11:49.219" style="s2">IF IT WEREN&#39;T FOR YOU,</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.059" end="01:11:51.899" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t have lost my inheritance. I</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.219" end="01:11:52.939" style="s2">WOULDN&#39;T BE BROKE!</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.899" end="01:11:54.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KEVIN,</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.939" end="01:11:56.019" style="s2">don&#39;t treat me like this. I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.899" end="01:11:57.499" style="s2">fiance.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.019" end="01:12:00.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m broke!</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.499" end="01:12:02.019" style="s2">What the hell do I need a fiance for?</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.019" end="01:12:03.704" style="s2">This engagement is over.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.019" end="01:12:05.724" style="s2">Get lost.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.704" end="01:12:05.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.219" end="01:12:08.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.019" end="01:12:10.659" style="s2">You can&#39;t end an engagement party</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.819" end="01:12:12.339" style="s2">halfway through.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.659" end="01:12:13.459" style="s2">How are we supposed to show our faces</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.339" end="01:12:15.179" style="s2">after this?</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.459" end="01:12:18.179" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.179" end="01:12:20.099" style="s2">Everything&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.179" end="01:12:22.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Consider it a tiny bit of compensation</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.099" end="01:12:24.579" style="s2">for my mother&#39;s death</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.299" end="01:12:26.059" style="s2">and for the seven years I spent in hell</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.579" end="01:12:29.179" style="s2">on Elysian</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.059" end="01:12:31.939" style="s2">while none of you lifted a finger.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.179" end="01:12:34.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.939" end="01:12:37.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, it&#39;s too loud in here.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.459" end="01:12:39.699" style="s2">Want to go somewhere quiet and talk?</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.619" end="01:12:42.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d love to.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.699" end="01:12:42.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.139" end="01:12:51.979" style="s2">Evelyn, I hear you spent seven years in</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.099" end="01:12:55.619" style="s2">the lawless black market of Elysian.</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.979" end="01:12:55.619" style="s2">When did you learn proper table manners?</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.179" end="01:13:04.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was 12 when I was sold to Elysian.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.179" end="01:13:06.739" style="s2">The Blooms may not be on the Wilsons&#39;</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.579" end="01:13:08.619" style="s2">level, but they&#39;re still old money.</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.739" end="01:13:11.379" style="s2">Of course I learned basic etiquette. But</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.619" end="01:13:12.899" style="s2">the way you carry yourself,</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.379" end="01:13:15.059" style="s2">that&#39;s straight out of a European royal</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.899" end="01:13:18.979" style="s2">court.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.059" end="01:13:18.979" style="s2">Does the Wilson family have royal ties?</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.031" end="01:13:22.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.659" end="01:13:24.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We do a lot of business in Europe. I</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.739" end="01:13:26.659" style="s2">spend several months there every year</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.259" end="01:13:28.099" style="s2">and picked up a few things.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.659" end="01:13:30.020" style="s2">But you,</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.099" end="01:13:33.620" style="s2">that move in the cafeteria was fast and</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.020" end="01:13:33.620" style="s2">clean. You look trained.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.940" end="01:13:37.020" style="s2">Did you study combat?</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.781" end="01:13:43.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I first reached Elysium, the</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.460" end="01:13:44.781" style="s2">traffickers nearly beat me to death.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.220" end="01:13:46.300" style="s2">In a hell like that, no one&#39;s coming to</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.781" end="01:13:49.260" style="s2">save you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.300" end="01:13:49.260" style="s2">You save yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.300" end="01:13:53.500" style="s2">I trained for a few years with an old</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.980" end="01:13:55.380" style="s2">underground fighter in the slums.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.500" end="01:13:58.300" style="s2">Just self-defense.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.380" end="01:14:00.860" style="s2">Nothing professional.</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.300" end="01:14:02.500" style="s2">But you recognized it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.860" end="01:14:04.500" style="s2">Are you secretly some kind of combat</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.500" end="01:14:06.620" style="s2">expert?</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.500" end="01:14:08.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The underworld is dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.620" end="01:14:10.340" style="s2">And I value my life.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.860" end="01:14:12.660" style="s2">I picked up a few moves from the family</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.340" end="01:14:15.340" style="s2">security team.</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.660" end="01:14:16.500" style="s2">I also learned a little XSS.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.340" end="01:14:17.900" style="s2">It comes in handy when you need an</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.500" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">escape route.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.900" end="01:14:21.260" style="s2">&gt;&gt; XSS?</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.340" end="01:14:23.500" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that a hacking thing?</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.260" end="01:14:25.660" style="s2">&gt;&gt; XSS is just a web scripting language,</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.500" end="01:14:27.620" style="s2">but it can be used for spoofing attacks.</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.660" end="01:14:29.420" style="s2">Only elite hackers</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.620" end="01:14:31.180" style="s2">know how to weaponize it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.420" end="01:14:32.860" style="s2">So, how do you know so much, Evelyn? Did</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.180" end="01:14:35.820" style="s2">that old fighter in the Elysian slums</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.860" end="01:14:35.820" style="s2">teach you hacking, too?</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.900" end="01:14:45.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The fighter in the slums didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.220" end="01:14:45.380" style="s2">anything about hacking.</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.340" end="01:14:50.740" style="s2">Before I was 12, when I still lived with</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.500" end="01:14:53.220" style="s2">my family,</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.740" end="01:14:55.380" style="s2">I was always great at math.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.220" end="01:14:58.860" style="s2">I read a lot of programming books and</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.380" end="01:15:01.300" style="s2">even built a few simple programs myself.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.860" end="01:15:01.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.300" end="01:15:06.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After 7 years on Elysium, I&#39;m a little</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.060" end="01:15:06.620" style="s2">rusty.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.500" end="01:15:12.620" style="s2">But you, Mr. Wilson,</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.980" end="01:15:16.140" style="s2">you&#39;re a business titan, yet you know</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.620" end="01:15:19.420" style="s2">some very technical cyber jargon.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.140" end="01:15:19.420" style="s2">Are you an elite hacker, too?</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.220" end="01:15:23.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You give me too much credit.</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.340" end="01:15:26.500" style="s2">I oversee the Wilson family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.740" end="01:15:27.940" style="s2">hundred-billion-dollar empire.</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.500" end="01:15:29.700" style="s2">I have no reason to learn anything about</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.940" end="01:15:32.260" style="s2">the dark web.</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.700" end="01:15:33.307" style="s2">I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.260" end="01:15:33.542" style="s2">May I have this dance?</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.307" end="01:15:37.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.542" end="01:15:37.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, I&#39;d love to.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.502" end="01:15:47.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, my hand slipped. You don&#39;t mind,</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.942" end="01:15:49.302" style="s2">do you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.582" end="01:15:51.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.302" end="01:15:52.342" style="s2">Sorry, I&#39;m a little tired tonight. My</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.062" end="01:15:53.342" style="s2">knees are giving out and I can&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.342" end="01:15:55.582" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.342" end="01:15:56.782" style="s2">Hope I haven&#39;t ruined the mood.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.582" end="01:15:59.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re tired, you should head back to</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.782" end="01:16:02.382" style="s2">Wilson Manor and rest.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.062" end="01:16:02.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, good night.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.022" end="01:16:13.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane, I&#39;ve confirmed it.</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.302" end="01:16:16.022" style="s2">She&#39;s Nova, leader of Black Stellar.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.262" end="01:16:18.982" style="s2">Assemble Dark Suns&#39; entire core team.</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.022" end="01:16:18.982" style="s2">Prepare for war.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.942" end="01:16:25.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur, I&#39;ve confirmed it. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.182" end="01:16:28.182" style="s2">Overlord, leader of Dark Sun.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.742" end="01:16:29.542" style="s2">Execute our original plan. At the gala</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.182" end="01:16:32.582" style="s2">in 3 days,</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.542" end="01:16:32.582" style="s2">he won&#39;t leave alive.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.702" end="01:16:39.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Smith, please. Mr. Smith, please.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.902" end="01:16:42.902" style="s2">Just give me a few more days. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.502" end="01:16:45.142" style="s2">the money. I&#39;ll pay you back, I swear.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.902" end="01:16:46.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Blooms are already bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.142" end="01:16:48.622" style="s2">What exactly are you going to pay us</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.302" end="01:16:48.622" style="s2">with?</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.302" end="01:16:53.102" style="s2">That marble support column looks like it</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.862" end="01:16:55.142" style="s2">might be worth something.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.102" end="01:16:57.102" style="s2">Get a crew and tear it out.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.142" end="01:16:58.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over. I thought Mary and Kevin</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.102" end="01:17:01.262" style="s2">would take the Blooms straight to the</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.382" end="01:17:03.142" style="s2">top. How did it all come to this?</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.262" end="01:17:04.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful child. If you hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.142" end="01:17:06.742" style="s2">insisted on stealing your sister&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.382" end="01:17:08.542" style="s2">fiance, would this family be in ruins?</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.742" end="01:17:09.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re the one who said Evelyn had</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.542" end="01:17:11.502" style="s2">been trafficked to Elixium and was as</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.782" end="01:17:12.862" style="s2">good as dead. You told me to go after</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.502" end="01:17:14.982" style="s2">Kevin. How is this my fault?</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.862" end="01:17:17.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Don&#39;t blame Lena. Blame that</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.982" end="01:17:18.862" style="s2">little [ __ ] Evelyn. She knows exactly</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.102" end="01:17:20.102" style="s2">how to play men and Sebastian does</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.862" end="01:17:23.662" style="s2">whatever she wants.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.102" end="01:17:23.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all Evelyn&#39;s fault.</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.902" end="01:17:26.582" style="s2">Yes, Mom, Dad, we haven&#39;t lost yet.</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.662" end="01:17:27.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.582" end="01:17:29.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Orion Syndicate just sent an</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.902" end="01:17:31.102" style="s2">internal memo.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.862" end="01:17:32.902" style="s2">They&#39;re planning to develop chips with</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.102" end="01:17:34.182" style="s2">the Wilson family.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.902" end="01:17:35.422" style="s2">The Wilsons have been desperate for this</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.182" end="01:17:37.503" style="s2">project.</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.422" end="01:17:38.703" style="s2">If I claim I brokered the deal, do you</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.503" end="01:17:41.583" style="s2">really think they&#39;ll still oppose my</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.703" end="01:17:41.583" style="s2">marriage to Kevin?</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.903" end="01:17:49.263" style="s2">Do you really think Mr. Wilson will buy</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.463" end="01:17:50.983" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.263" end="01:17:52.903" style="s2">It&#39;s inside information from Orion</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.983" end="01:17:55.063" style="s2">Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.903" end="01:17:57.103" style="s2">It hasn&#39;t been announced yet.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.063" end="01:17:58.503" style="s2">I say I brokered the deal, then the news</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.103" end="01:18:00.343" style="s2">breaks.</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.503" end="01:18:01.583" style="s2">Who can prove otherwise?</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.343" end="01:18:03.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.583" end="01:18:06.183" style="s2">Go get ready. If you nail this marriage</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.903" end="01:18:08.743" style="s2">and win old Mr. Wilson&#39;s support, I can</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.183" end="01:18:11.164" style="s2">take Evelyn down however I want.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.743" end="01:18:13.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter always has a way. You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.164" end="01:18:13.983" style="s2">[snorts] best.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.703" end="01:18:18.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nova, are we really going to fight Dark</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.063" end="01:18:19.583" style="s2">Sun to the death?</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.223" end="01:18:20.623" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, you&#39;re scared?</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.583" end="01:18:21.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.623" end="01:18:23.943" style="s2">Since I met you, I&#39;ve run hundreds of</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.943" end="01:18:25.103" style="s2">operations, big and small. I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.943" end="01:18:27.539" style="s2">been afraid once.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.103" end="01:18:27.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you hesitating?</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.539" end="01:18:28.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.823" end="01:18:30.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just worried you might not be able</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.983" end="01:18:31.703" style="s2">to go through with it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.423" end="01:18:32.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.703" end="01:18:34.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dark Sun and Black Stella have been at</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.983" end="01:18:36.223" style="s2">each other&#39;s throats for a month. Over</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.903" end="01:18:37.903" style="s2">the past 3 years, though, it&#39;s mostly</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.223" end="01:18:39.383" style="s2">been competition. More than once, they</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.903" end="01:18:41.303" style="s2">exposed weaknesses we hadn&#39;t seen and</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.383" end="01:18:42.623" style="s2">helped us avoid disaster. Without Dark</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.303" end="01:18:44.303" style="s2">Sun, Black Stella could never have</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.623" end="01:18:45.463" style="s2">replaced Elysium&#39;s old guard so quickly</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.303" end="01:18:46.183" style="s2">and become the world&#39;s top assassin</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.463" end="01:18:47.623" style="s2">organization.</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.183" end="01:18:49.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing else matters. They&#39;ve targeted</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.623" end="01:18:49.663" style="s2">us for no reason. That&#39;s enough to wipe</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.063" end="01:18:51.423" style="s2">them out.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.663" end="01:18:53.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It makes no sense. I&#39;ve looked into it</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.423" end="01:18:54.183" style="s2">for ages and I still can&#39;t find anything</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.103" end="01:18:55.343" style="s2">we did to provoke them.</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.183" end="01:18:57.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take positions around the Orion</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.343" end="01:18:58.743" style="s2">reception. If something goes wrong, find</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.183" end="01:19:00.223" style="s2">a way to back me up. Until I give the</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.743" end="01:19:02.863" style="s2">order, no one moves.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.223" end="01:19:02.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Nova.</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.143" end="01:19:09.463" style="s2">Boss, are we really doing this? I dealt</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.983" end="01:19:11.143" style="s2">with Nova in the underworld. I thought</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.463" end="01:19:12.423" style="s2">she was a bloodthirsty psychopath, but</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.143" end="01:19:14.263" style="s2">after spending time around Evelyn these</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.423" end="01:19:15.863" style="s2">past few days, she doesn&#39;t feel like</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.263" end="01:19:17.303" style="s2">that kind of person. Weren&#39;t you the one</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.863" end="01:19:18.583" style="s2">pushing me to move against her? Think</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.303" end="01:19:20.503" style="s2">about what she&#39;s been through. She could</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.583" end="01:19:21.943" style="s2">have killed Victoria, but she didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.503" end="01:19:23.503" style="s2">She went to enormous lengths to set the</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.943" end="01:19:24.943" style="s2">record straight for those traffic girls</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.503" end="01:19:26.423" style="s2">and make sure justice was served through</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.943" end="01:19:27.823" style="s2">the courts. Doesn&#39;t that at least</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.423" end="01:19:29.743" style="s2">suggest she&#39;s not some irredeemable</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.823" end="01:19:30.943" style="s2">monster? Don&#39;t forget, if Black Stella</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.743" end="01:19:32.623" style="s2">hadn&#39;t caused that mess on Elysium a</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.943" end="01:19:34.303" style="s2">month ago, Professor Van Dyke would have</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.623" end="01:19:35.943" style="s2">nearly been killed. He&#39;s the father of</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.303" end="01:19:37.303" style="s2">the American ship industry.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.943" end="01:19:40.704" style="s2">If anything happened to him, a hundred</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.303" end="01:19:40.704" style="s2">of my lives wouldn&#39;t make up for it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.184" end="01:19:44.545" style="s2">You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.385" end="01:19:46.025" style="s2">If an old friend of his hadn&#39;t saved</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.545" end="01:19:46.945" style="s2">him, we would have lost him. Did you</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.025" end="01:19:48.304" style="s2">find that person I asked you to look</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.945" end="01:19:49.415" style="s2">into? Once we do, we&#39;ll owe them a</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.304" end="01:19:49.664" style="s2">proper thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.415" end="01:19:50.704" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.664" end="01:19:51.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the professor gave us is an old</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.704" end="01:19:53.585" style="s2">friend. There&#39;s no way to identify</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.624" end="01:19:54.945" style="s2">someone from that. Forget it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.585" end="01:19:56.784" style="s2">What&#39;s this Orion Syndicate reception</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.945" end="01:19:58.144" style="s2">about? No idea. Arthur suddenly</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.784" end="01:20:00.144" style="s2">announced an open bid for partners and</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.144" end="01:20:01.545" style="s2">personally invited Professor Van Dyke.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.144" end="01:20:03.025" style="s2">We need that partnership, and we need to</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.545" end="01:20:04.704" style="s2">keep the professor safe. Nothing can</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.025" end="01:20:06.025" style="s2">happen to him. Have Dark Suns people</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.704" end="01:20:08.184" style="s2">infiltrate the reception early. If</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.025" end="01:20:09.505" style="s2">anything looks wrong, move immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.184" end="01:20:12.025" style="s2">Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.505" end="01:20:12.025" style="s2">What about you?</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.505" end="01:20:17.344" style="s2">Nova won&#39;t miss a gathering like this.</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.905" end="01:20:20.065" style="s2">The second she appears, I&#39;ll kill her</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.344" end="01:20:20.065" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.744" end="01:20:24.025" style="s2">Once we land the partnership between</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.905" end="01:20:25.784" style="s2">Orion Syndicate and the Wilsons, the</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.025" end="01:20:27.385" style="s2">Blooms won&#39;t just recover. We could rise</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.784" end="01:20:29.304" style="s2">even higher and become one of the West</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.385" end="01:20:31.065" style="s2">Coast&#39;s most powerful families.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.304" end="01:20:32.304" style="s2">Lena, you&#39;re a genius. After this, no</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.065" end="01:20:33.704" style="s2">matter how much Sebastian likes that</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.304" end="01:20:35.184" style="s2">[ __ ] Evelyn, he won&#39;t dare openly</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.704" end="01:20:36.144" style="s2">target the Blooms again. Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="01:20:35.184" end="01:20:38.184" style="s2">who&#39;d ever trust the Wilsons in</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.144" end="01:20:42.104" style="s2">business? Exactly. Lena, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.184" end="01:20:42.104" style="s2">extraordinary. That [ __ ] Evelyn can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.985" end="01:20:47.710" style="s2">Mom, Dad, you made it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.744" end="01:20:48.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Kevin.</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.710" end="01:20:49.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.224" end="01:20:51.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We only got the Orion Syndicate deal</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.545" end="01:20:53.224" style="s2">because Lena made the connection. Come</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.344" end="01:20:54.505" style="s2">on, I&#39;ll take you to see Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.224" end="01:20:55.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your grandfather&#39;s here, too?</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.505" end="01:20:56.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.385" end="01:20:59.664" style="s2">He&#39;s inside talking to Arthur, Orion</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.824" end="01:20:59.664" style="s2">Syndicate CEO.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.344" end="01:21:03.065" style="s2">I&#39;m Kevin Wilson. I&#39;m bringing Lena in</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.025" end="01:21:04.184" style="s2">to see my grandfather.</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.065" end="01:21:06.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling&#39;s in a meeting with your</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.184" end="01:21:08.945" style="s2">grandfather. They&#39;re not seeing anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.744" end="01:21:09.784" style="s2">You&#39;ll need to wait here, Mr. Wilson.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.945" end="01:21:10.264" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.784" end="01:21:12.505" style="s2">We&#39;ll wait.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.264" end="01:21:13.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s just a bodyguard. How dare he stop</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.505" end="01:21:14.985" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.824" end="01:21:16.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.985" end="01:21:19.784" style="s2">They work for Arthur.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.545" end="01:21:19.784" style="s2">If I can&#39;t get in, nobody can.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.425" end="01:21:23.624" style="s2">Evelyn, what are you doing at an event</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.704" end="01:21:25.344" style="s2">this exclusive?</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.624" end="01:21:26.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. This is top-tier chip industry</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.344" end="01:21:28.065" style="s2">gathering. You were trafficked for years</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.744" end="01:21:29.385" style="s2">with no formal schooling. What business</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.065" end="01:21:30.824" style="s2">do you have being here, idiot?</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.385" end="01:21:31.985" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even Kevin can&#39;t get in to see Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.824" end="01:21:32.864" style="s2">Sterling. Does she actually think</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.985" end="01:21:35.545" style="s2">they&#39;ll let her through?</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.864" end="01:21:35.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right this way, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.905" end="01:21:39.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, why do you get to go in?</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.505" end="01:21:41.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Orion Syndicate in there, meeting</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.945" end="01:21:42.865" style="s2">with the Wilson family. I&#39;m a Wilson,</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.745" end="01:21:45.345" style="s2">and even I can&#39;t get in. Why the hell</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.865" end="01:21:47.026" style="s2">does she get to?</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.345" end="01:21:48.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn was trafficked into Elysia&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.026" end="01:21:50.305" style="s2">black market 7 years ago. She never even</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.946" end="01:21:51.586" style="s2">finished school. Now she&#39;s trying to</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.305" end="01:21:53.146" style="s2">barge in and interrupt Mr. Sterling&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.586" end="01:21:54.986" style="s2">meeting with Mr. Wilson. She has no</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.146" end="01:21:56.626" style="s2">shame. WE HAVE TO STOP HER.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.986" end="01:21:57.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of us are allowed in.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.626" end="01:21:58.946" style="s2">Why should they let in someone who knows</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.825" end="01:22:00.385" style="s2">nothing?</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.946" end="01:22:02.146" style="s2">Or Orion Syndicate may be the hot new</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.385" end="01:22:04.946" style="s2">name in tech, but that doesn&#39;t mean they</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.146" end="01:22:06.466" style="s2">can ignore basic protocol.</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.946" end="01:22:08.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s all this noise?</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.466" end="01:22:10.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Wilson, it&#39;s me, Lena.</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.506" end="01:22:12.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena? The Wilsons no longer do business</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.705" end="01:22:14.186" style="s2">with the Blooms. Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.586" end="01:22:15.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, we only got a meeting with</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.186" end="01:22:17.146" style="s2">Orion Syndicate because Lena helped make</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.586" end="01:22:18.626" style="s2">the connection. I brought her so you</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.146" end="01:22:20.305" style="s2">could see how capable and talented she</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.626" end="01:22:21.626" style="s2">is.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.305" end="01:22:24.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She brokered the partnership between</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.626" end="01:22:25.906" style="s2">Orion Syndicate and the Wilson family?</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.066" end="01:22:27.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I&#39;m interning at Orion</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.906" end="01:22:28.345" style="s2">Syndicate and I recommended the</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.106" end="01:22:30.186" style="s2">partnership.</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.345" end="01:22:32.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the Bloom prodigy really lives up to</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.186" end="01:22:33.146" style="s2">the name. She hasn&#39;t even graduated and</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.026" end="01:22:35.705" style="s2">she&#39;s already interning at Orion</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.146" end="01:22:35.705" style="s2">Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.745" end="01:22:39.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You actually believe an intern connected</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.345" end="01:22:40.825" style="s2">two major corporations?</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.026" end="01:22:42.466" style="s2">You&#39;re even dumber than I thought.</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.825" end="01:22:44.146" style="s2">I may only be an intern, but I work at</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.466" end="01:22:45.466" style="s2">Orion Syndicate. That&#39;s something a</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.146" end="01:22:47.345" style="s2">woman from the black market could never</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.466" end="01:22:48.887" style="s2">dream of. Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.345" end="01:22:49.426" style="s2">You&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.887" end="01:22:53.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.426" end="01:22:53.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who the hell are you? You can&#39;t fire me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.345" end="01:22:59.385" style="s2">How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.106" end="01:23:03.466" style="s2">How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.666" end="01:23:05.186" style="s2">Evelyn, what did you do to make Orion</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.466" end="01:23:06.745" style="s2">Syndicate fire me? I don&#39;t believe it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.186" end="01:23:09.825" style="s2">This has to be fake.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.745" end="01:23:09.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling&#39;s coming out.</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.986" end="01:23:13.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, Evelyn teamed up with some</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.946" end="01:23:14.546" style="s2">scammer who pretended to be from Orion</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.146" end="01:23:15.906" style="s2">Syndicate HR and sent me that message.</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.546" end="01:23:18.186" style="s2">She seriously damaged the COMPANY&#39;S</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.906" end="01:23:21.305" style="s2">REPUTATION. SHE HAS TO BE PUNISHED.</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.186" end="01:23:22.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The message is real. You&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.305" end="01:23:23.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.506" end="01:23:24.705" style="s2">Why does she get to fire me just because</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.946" end="01:23:26.986" style="s2">she says so?</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.705" end="01:23:28.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, Evelyn is my daughter. I</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.986" end="01:23:29.946" style="s2">know her. She never even finished</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.186" end="01:23:31.546" style="s2">school. You can&#39;t take her word and fire</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.946" end="01:23:32.626" style="s2">Lena. She&#39;s the chairwoman of Orion</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.546" end="01:23:34.385" style="s2">Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.626" end="01:23:36.066" style="s2">Filing one little intern is nothing. She</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.385" end="01:23:38.225" style="s2">could fire me and I&#39;d have no choice but</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.066" end="01:23:40.546" style="s2">to accept it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.225" end="01:23:42.785" style="s2">Madam Chair.</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.546" end="01:23:45.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s the chairwoman of Orion Syndicate?</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.785" end="01:23:45.626" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.067" end="01:23:48.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave up an [music] engagement to Orion</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.307" end="01:23:50.187" style="s2">Syndicate&#39;s chairwoman</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.827" end="01:23:52.107" style="s2">for an intern who just got fired.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.187" end="01:23:53.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, you can&#39;t fire me. I</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.107" end="01:23:55.467" style="s2">earned my place at Orion Syndicate. Do</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.707" end="01:23:58.187" style="s2">you know T theory? I developed it. It</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.467" end="01:23:59.707" style="s2">can optimize chip processing speed.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.187" end="01:24:01.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have the nerve to say you developed</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.707" end="01:24:01.947" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.987" end="01:24:05.587" style="s2">I patented that theory 8 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.267" end="01:24:06.747" style="s2">You stole it and claimed it as your own</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.587" end="01:24:08.147" style="s2">research.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.747" end="01:24:09.467" style="s2">Shameless.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.147" end="01:24:12.027" style="s2">As of today, you&#39;re no longer my</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.467" end="01:24:12.027" style="s2">student.</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.427" end="01:24:17.387" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.187" end="01:24:17.387" style="s2">This time it&#39;s really over.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.907" end="01:24:21.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, the famous Bloom prodigy is nothing</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.867" end="01:24:23.867" style="s2">but a fraud. Stealing someone else&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.707" end="01:24:24.387" style="s2">academic work is enough to land her in</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.867" end="01:24:26.507" style="s2">prison.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.387" end="01:24:27.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She stole other people&#39;s academic work.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.507" end="01:24:29.427" style="s2">The Orion Wills partnership was ordered</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.907" end="01:24:30.627" style="s2">by our chairwoman. None of this has</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.427" end="01:24:31.787" style="s2">anything to do with you. Security,</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.627" end="01:24:34.107" style="s2">escort these people out.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.787" end="01:24:36.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Evelyn, I&#39;m your dad. You can&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.107" end="01:24:36.707" style="s2">THIS TO ME.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.747" end="01:24:40.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU REALLY ARE THE chairwoman of Orion</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.347" end="01:24:40.947" style="s2">Syndicate.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.067" end="01:24:42.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Wilson.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.947" end="01:24:44.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. 7 years ago, I knew there was</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.827" end="01:24:46.347" style="s2">something special about you. After all</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.587" end="01:24:48.107" style="s2">these years, you&#39;re still remarkable.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.347" end="01:24:48.747" style="s2">Shame my blind fool of a grandson never</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.107" end="01:24:49.427" style="s2">deserved you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.747" end="01:24:51.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too kind.</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.427" end="01:24:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Bloom, it&#39;s an honor. I saw who was</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.507" end="01:24:55.907" style="s2">credited with the theory. It was you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.427" end="01:24:58.187" style="s2">You were only 11. You&#39;re a true genius.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.907" end="01:24:59.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me, sir. Mr. Wilson, Arthur can go over</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.187" end="01:25:01.147" style="s2">the details of the partnership with you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.987" end="01:25:01.907" style="s2">I have something to handle, so I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.147" end="01:25:05.427" style="s2">leave you to it.</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.907" end="01:25:07.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Go take care of it.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.427" end="01:25:09.667" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nova, Dark Sun&#39;s leader, Overlord, has</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.507" end="01:25:11.187" style="s2">entered the villa. He actually came.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.667" end="01:25:13.267" style="s2">Then it&#39;s time to settle everything.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.187" end="01:25:15.707" style="s2">Stay outside. Don&#39;t let anyone into the</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.267" end="01:25:15.707" style="s2">villa.</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.709" end="01:25:32.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.674" end="01:25:32.694" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.947" end="01:25:39.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, that psycho actually fired at</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.107" end="01:25:41.507" style="s2">me at Wilson Manor. He&#39;s always so</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.867" end="01:25:43.187" style="s2">polished, cold, and buttoned-up, but in</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.507" end="01:25:43.787" style="s2">a fight, every move is lethal. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.187" end="01:25:46.187" style="s2">ruthless.</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.787" end="01:25:47.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The infamous, shadowy Nova, leader of</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.187" end="01:25:49.309" style="s2">Black Stellar, snuck into the Wilson</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.908" end="01:25:51.509" style="s2">Manor playing the helpless good girl</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.309" end="01:25:52.948" style="s2">act. Quite the elaborate deception.</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.509" end="01:25:54.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I never would have guessed that Dark</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.948" end="01:25:56.349" style="s2">Sun&#39;s overlord, the man constantly</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.669" end="01:25:58.789" style="s2">putting bounties on Black Stellar across</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.349" end="01:26:00.189" style="s2">the Dark Wet, was Sebastian Wilson, the</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.789" end="01:26:01.669" style="s2">head of the Wilson family and the guy</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.189" end="01:26:04.069" style="s2">who supposedly wanted nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.669" end="01:26:04.069" style="s2">women.</p>
<p begin="01:26:05.269" end="01:26:09.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, you&#39;re one step behind.</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.269" end="01:26:09.869" style="s2">You lose.</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.989" end="01:26:11.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.939" end="01:26:13.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.948" end="01:26:15.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t give up that easily. I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.469" end="01:26:16.829" style="s2">dying to see whether the legendary</p>
<p begin="01:26:15.109" end="01:26:20.389" style="s2">overlord of Dark Sun is really as</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.829" end="01:26:22.948" style="s2">terrifying as they say. Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="01:26:20.389" end="01:26:24.549" style="s2">looks like you&#39;re the one who lost.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.948" end="01:26:27.629" style="s2">Guess I&#39;m still one step ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.549" end="01:26:27.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t be so sure.</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.948" end="01:26:31.549" style="s2">A month ago on Elysian,</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.948" end="01:26:32.989" style="s2">I let my guard down and you got the jump</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.549" end="01:26:34.589" style="s2">on me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.989" end="01:26:37.789" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.589" end="01:26:37.789" style="s2">let&#39;s see what else you&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.709" end="01:26:44.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor Van Dyke?</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.428" end="01:26:46.189" style="s2">What are you doing here? It&#39;s dangerous</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.749" end="01:26:47.469" style="s2">inside. Boss is in there fighting Black</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.189" end="01:26:48.749" style="s2">Stellar&#39;s leader to the death.</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.469" end="01:26:51.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.749" end="01:26:52.428" style="s2">Make them stop. You&#39;ve got it all wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.309" end="01:26:53.389" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor, what do you mean we&#39;ve got it</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.428" end="01:26:54.948" style="s2">wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.389" end="01:26:56.389" style="s2">That&#39;s Nova of Black Stellar, the woman</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.948" end="01:26:57.789" style="s2">who nearly got you killed on Elysian a</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.389" end="01:27:00.509" style="s2">month ago.</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.789" end="01:27:02.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nearly got me killed? You idiots have it</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.509" end="01:27:04.989" style="s2">completely backward. If Nova hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.789" end="01:27:07.469" style="s2">saved me on Elysian a month ago, the</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.989" end="01:27:08.709" style="s2">traffickers would have killed me. She is</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.469" end="01:27:10.469" style="s2">not your enemy.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.709" end="01:27:12.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.469" end="01:27:16.109" style="s2">The old friend who saved you was Nova?</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.829" end="01:27:16.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. She saved my life. She&#39;s not my</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.109" end="01:27:18.309" style="s2">enemy.</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.629" end="01:27:19.589" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re screwed.</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.309" end="01:27:20.389" style="s2">Boss is in there trying to kill her</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.589" end="01:27:22.349" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.389" end="01:27:23.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR? MOVE! BREAK</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.349" end="01:27:27.789" style="s2">DOWN THE DOOR! IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.869" end="01:27:27.789" style="s2">BOSS OR EVELYN, WE&#39;RE ALL DEAD!</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.269" end="01:27:37.469" style="s2">BOSS! EVELYN!</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.428" end="01:27:37.469" style="s2">STOP! IT&#39;S ALL A MISUNDERSTANDING!</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.549" end="01:27:41.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT?</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.229" end="01:27:42.908" style="s2">What What exactly is going on here?</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.069" end="01:27:45.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him go.</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.908" end="01:27:47.629" style="s2">Evelyn, Sebastian is with Dark Sun. A</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.469" end="01:27:49.590" style="s2">month ago on Elysian, he was the one who</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.629" end="01:27:51.430" style="s2">sent people to help me from the shadows</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.590" end="01:27:52.990" style="s2">and steer your team away from danger.</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.430" end="01:27:54.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it was you who saved the professor on</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.990" end="01:27:55.390" style="s2">Elysian a month [music] ago.</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.150" end="01:27:59.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I never would have guessed the man</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.390" end="01:27:59.430" style="s2">who worked with me to save him was you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.350" end="01:28:04.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that we&#39;ve cleared up the</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.350" end="01:28:08.670" style="s2">misunderstanding, maybe get out.</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.910" end="01:28:08.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss. Professor, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.426" end="01:28:17.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.110" end="01:28:20.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Issue the order.</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.790" end="01:28:21.950" style="s2">Effective immediately, Dark Sun and</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.030" end="01:28:25.870" style="s2">Black Stellar are merging. Evelyn will</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.950" end="01:28:25.870" style="s2">assume full command of Dark Sun.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.390" end="01:28:35.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $10 billion? Dollars?</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.630" end="01:28:36.710" style="s2">We just wrapped up our internal conflict</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.270" end="01:28:38.630" style="s2">and already we&#39;ve got one hell of a job</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.710" end="01:28:39.750" style="s2">waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.630" end="01:28:41.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s show the world what we can</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.750" end="01:28:43.301" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.281" end="01:28:43.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
